<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Ngindo Bible Vesion</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Luka nga gumwe kati ja itabu ncheche imu Lilagano Liyono elilanduli kutama kwa Yesu Kilisto padunia. Kila kitabu kikemigwa, “Injili” mana gakwe “Nhwalo Gwambone.” Uandikigwa na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana kuboka pukujomoka Yesu. Luka ngiti aandiki nhwalo gu kutama kwa Yesu padunia tuje, nambu uyo aandiki ilebe yabatenda akinapunji ba Yesu, kuboka pukujomoka Yesu nu kuyoka, mukitabu chikikemigwa Itendwa ya Achandundame. Abije mundu jwamanyi kingobugani puandikigwa Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Luka andaje paali puandikigwa, nambu akachomi bajekatile kutenda iwechakine uandikigwa chaka cha 70 kuboka pukubelekwa Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhwandiki Luka, jwakiba nng'anga. Ndela jatumi kuandika ni kilongela ilaya kutenda akiba nchomi. Luka aandike kipola nhwalo gu kutama kwa Yesu padunia, ngalanduli ikobo andi pikiba, kuyene bandu baotwi kujangatigwa pabachoma genia (Luka 1:1-3). Jwenio akiba Nhyahudije (Kolosai 4:10-14) Aandika kupala kila mundu jwanga Nhyahudi amanye. Yene ibonekana palandulila lukobo lwa Akayahudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Luka utekulandana muno ni kitabu cha Matayo na Maluko, gambu ilanduli ile imwe nu kukulandana. Kati ji itabu itatu, Luka alandulile ilebe ndu nhwalo gu kubelekwa kwa Yohana Mmatichi. Luka uyo akwajali nhwalo gu kulekeke malemwa (Lipungu lya 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) Nu kugongalela (Lipungu lya 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Luka atumbu Nhwalo Gwambone kukulenga gambu gu kuandika (Lipungu lya 1:1-4).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe alandulile kubelekwa kwa Yesu na kabe Yesu pajipanganikia ndela jiliengo lyakwe (Lipungu lya 1:5-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">Kipande kikolongwa chikiigile mu Nhwalo Gwambone, Luka alanduli liengo lyatenda Yesu, muno ikobo yatendaga ni ilebe yabolaga (Lipungu lya 4:14-21:38).</para>
  <para style="io">Mumapungu mabena gukujomolela, Luka alanduli kujomoka kwa Yesu, nu kuchikigwa nu kuyoka kwakwe (Lipungu lya 22-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mana Teofilo, bandu ajingi baandike ilebe andi pabaotalinge nhwalo gwa ipitile kwito. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Andi pubutulandulila abakiba akachaili abagabweni, na akapakachi bi lilobe lyenie kutumbu lolo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na ialile nane ananhota magambu njomite kukuingikia ilebe yenie kuboka pitumbulaga mbemele iba chwapi kunhwandakila gwe Teofilo nhwalo gongo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndenda yenie kupala mmanye kweli joa ja kila kilebe echimmoligwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutangacha kubelekwa kwa Yohana Mmatichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kingobu Helode apakiba Nngwana jwa ku Yudea, pakiba na Nkung'i jumwe liina lyakwe Zakalia, jukikuta cha Abiya. Lina lya aanamundu bakemigwa Elizabeti jwombe uyo akiba ju lungolo lwa nkung'i Aluni. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Boa akabena bakiba bambone nnongi Nnoongo, bakibanga kengama Malagilo ga Angwana ana Nnoongo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu bapatangiteje ingota magambu Elizabeti akiba ntonga na boa akabele bakibanga bagoiminge muno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe Zakalia apakiba akakamula liengo lyakwe andi nkung'i mu Nyumba ja Nnoongo, ikiba jamu jakwe jukubegelela. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Andi pikiba lukobo lwabe Zakalia ngachaguligwa kujenda mu nyumba ja Nnoongo kuukalikia ubani ejibakengama akakung'i, nnongi nkati mwa nyumba ja Nnoongo. Yenie ngajenda nnongi ja Nyumba ngolongwa ja Angwana, <verse number="10" style="v"/>kingobucho bandu ajingi bakiba bakonganinge panja kung'ongalela Nnoongo kingobu cha kuukalakia ubani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mpakachi jwa Angwana kuboka kumbengu ngampitila Zakalia umwo nnyumba ngajema kingono cha kalelo chikitembe chukuukalakia ubani. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zakalia apammona mpakachi jwenio ngaomongwa na ngajogopa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu mpakachi jo nganengela, “Zakalia makajogopaje Nnoongo ajowine kugongalela kwinu na Elizabeti aanabinu mabapotola mwana munalome. Mampa liina lyakwe Yohana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mma na laa ngolongwa, na bandu ajingi mabannulatila kwa kubelekwa kwakwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apakube nkolongwa nnongi ja Angwana, ainyweje divai, wala chukunywe kikale matwelela Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mababuyanga bandu ajingi bu Kuisilaeli Kangwana ana Nnoongo babe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jwenio balongalela Angwana akalongoleigwa na makakala nu uhuke andi nnondoli Eliya jwa Nnoongo. Mababeka akawawa na ingota kupalana, mabagalambuya bandu bangajali babe na mawacho gambone, babekanga maha bandu ba Angwana kwa magambu gabe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Zakalia ngannengela Mpakachi, kuboka kumbengu numanyabo nhwalo gweniogo? Nane ng'oime na akango unyaela? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mpakachi ngajanga, “Ne na Gabulieli, nanyema nnongi ja Nnoongo, bangingite nonge namwenga nannenge Nhwalo gwa mbone gongo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gambu gwanga amini gwinu mma mabubu. Nhwotoje kulongela mpaka aganannengila galenganile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mangobu genia, bandu bakiba bakannendanga Zakalia ngabaomongwa kukuchelwa kwakwe Unyumba ja Nnoongo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apapita panja aotwije kulongela na bandu ngabamanya kutenda aibweni ikobo Munyumba ja Nnoongo. Aotwije kulongela kilebe, alangila numaboko gakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Zakalia apajomola jamu jakwe ja kubegalela Munyumba ja Nnoongo, ngabuja kachakwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kubokapenia Elizabeti aanaba Zakalia ngabapata ndumbo. Nambu ngibikiiya unyumba kwa myei nhwano. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ngalenga, “Ngoe Angwana banyangite, bamoite oni jango nnongi ja bandu!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubelekwa kwa Yesu kutenda kutangachigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwei gwa sita gwa ndumbo ja Elizabeti, Nnoongo ngankinga mpakachi Gabulieli kuboka kumbengu ajende kukilambo cha ku Nazaleti okwo Ku Galilaya, <verse number="27" style="v"/>kwa kamwale jumwe, ojwalagine kutolana na mundu jumwe ojwa kemigwa Yusufu jwa lungolo lwa Daudi. Lina lya kamwale jwenio Maliamu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mpakachi kuboka Kumbengu ngannyendela ngannengela, “Tengela jibe pamwe namwe! Angwana babi pamwe na mwenga na bampi upeele muno!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Maliamu pajoa malobe genia ngaechuka muno, kugaacha malobe genia mana gakwe nike? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mpakachi kuboka kumbengu ngannengela, “Makajogopaje Maliamu, Nnoongo ampi upeele. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mampata ndumbo, mampotola mwana munalome na mampa liina lyakwe Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Jwenio maba nkolongwa na akemigwa Mwana jwa Nnoongo ojwabi kunani muno. Angwana ana Nnoongo mabampa kitebu cha Nngwana Daudi aoko mundu, <verse number="33" style="v"/>jwenio nga nngwana ju lungolo lwa Yakobo machoba goa pangapela, kingwana chakwe kiba cha machoba goa pangapela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Maliamu ngannengela mpakachi kuboka kumbengu, “Kilebe chenie kiba bole? Nanenga nanabeje na munulome tangu nabelekwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mpakachi kuboka kumbengu ngajanga, “Uhuke jwa Nnoongo manhwikilila, na makakala ga Nnoongo maganhwekelela kwa magambu genia Mwana ojwapa kubelekwa akemigwa Nchwapi, akemigwa Mwana jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nkombokela nnongo gwinu Elizabeti, aganu kube mbuja, akweti ndumbo gongo mwei gwa sita ojwamanyakine na bandu kube ntonga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwa magambu libije lyangaotola Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Maliamu ngalenga, “Nenga napakachi ba Angwana, ibe anda apannengite.” Na mpakachi kuboka kumbengu nganneka.</para>
  <para style="s">Maliamu antyangi Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuboka pamachoba machoko, Maliamu ngaboka mwanja ngajenda chokwe mpaka kilambo echikibi kuitombi ya Yudea. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwenio ngajingi unyumba ja Zakalia ngampata abali Elizabeti. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Elizabeti apajoa abali ja Maliamu, kingota cha mulutumbo mwa Elizabeti ngikiina. Elizabeti nganhwikili Uhuke jwa Chwapi, <verse number="42" style="v"/>ngalongela kwa lilobe likolongwa, “Nkweti kindimba kupeta akikege boa na mwana ojwapakubelekwa akoigwe. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kunike kilebe kikolongwa kipitilile kwango, ata amama ba Angwana bango baike kwango nenga? <verse number="44" style="v"/>Apanyoina abali jinu, mwana mulutumbo lwango ngainaina kukuala mojo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mbaya mwe manhwamine kutenda kilebe chibalenga Angwana kwinu makilenganila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwambo gwa Maliamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Maliamu ngalenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mwojo gwango gwalumba Angwana,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>uhuke gwango ubi nalaa magambu Nnoongo Nkomboi jwango.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Magambu bandekungombokela nammanda gwabe nachoko!</para>
  <para style="q">Kuboka ngoe bandu boa bangema mbaya,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>kwa magambu ilebe ikolongwa eyandendi Nnoongo ojwabi Nkolongwa Angwana bandendi kilebe kikolongwa.</para>
  <para style="q">Lina lyabe bachwapi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>kutumbu kibelei chimwe mpaka chenge</para>
  <para style="q">alaya kia jakwe kwa bandu abannyali, <verse number="51" style="v"/>batei ilebe ikolongwa kwa maboko gabe gina makakala</para>
  <para style="q">bapechengine bandu bina uongwajagi muma wacho ga umojo jabe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Bauluinge akangwana bina makakala muitebu yabe</para>
  <para style="q">ngabatondobea bandu bina kunyenyepa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Bina njala bapi ilebe ya mbone,</para>
  <para style="q">bandu bina ela balekangite bajendange maboko jika</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Akombakile malagano gakwe agalagana na akinanhota bito,</para>
  <para style="q">bajangatinge akapakachi bakwe Isilaeli, <verse number="55" style="v"/>andi pabalengela akawabito,</para>
  <para style="q">Ulaimu ni ibelei yakwe yoa pangapela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Maliamu ngatama na Elizabeti kwa myei mitatu kuboka penia ngabuja kachakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubelekwa kwa Yohana Mmatichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Kingobu cha kukikombola kwa Elizabeti ngikiika, ngapotola mwana munalome. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Akandami ajabe na akalongamundu apabajoa kutenda Angwana bammoni kia Elizabeti, ngabaala mwojo pamwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Lichoba lya nane apalyaika, ngabajenda kunhina mwana, ngabapalanga kumpe liina lya awamundu, Zakalia. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Nambu amamundu ngabalenga, “Lyeneje nambu akemigwe Yohana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Bandu ngabannengela Elizabeti, “Abije mundu mulungolo lwakwe juna liina andi lyenele?” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Kuboka penia bandu ngababeke kiingi awamundu bapala balenge liina lya mwana lebilipala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Zakalia ngajopa kibao chukuandikila na ngaandika, “Liina lyakwe Yohana.” Boa ngabaomongwa! <verse number="64" style="v"/>Upo Zakalia ngatumbu kulongela kabele, ngannumba Nnoongo. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Ngababeganga na mbwele akandami ajabe boa, nhwalo gwenio ngujoanika mwitombi yoa eibi kukilambo cha Kuyudea. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kila mundu ojwajoine nhwalo gwenio ngawacha nu ukonya, “Mwana ojo apakubebo?” Magambu ibonekana kipola kube makakala ga Nnoongo gakiba pamwe nakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulondola kwa Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Zakalia, awamundu Yohana, ngatwele Uhuke jwa Chwapi, ngalenga nhwalo gwa Nnoongo gongo,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>“Talumbe Angwana ana Nnoongo bu Kuisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q">baike kajangata bandu bakwe na kakombola.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Butupile nkomboi juna makakala,</para>
  <para style="q">ju lungolo lwa Daudi mpakachi jwabe. <verse number="70" style="v"/>Andi palenga kutumbu lolo, kupete kwa akalondoli bakwe ba chwapi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Kutenda mabutukombola kwa akangondwa bito,</para>
  <para style="q">nu mumaboko ga boa ababutuchimwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Ngabalenga mabakolela kia akananhota bito,</para>
  <para style="q">nu kombokela lilagano lyabe lya chwapi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Nnoongo ngampe lilagano nhwoko gwito Ulaimu, <verse number="74" style="v"/>ngalagila kutukombola kuboka kwa akangondo bito</para>
  <para style="q">bakabe na mbweleje tabegelele panga mbwele, <verse number="75" style="v"/>tube tambone andi papala Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="q">machoba goa gukulama kwito.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>Mwe mamanango, mankemigwa, nnondoli jwa Nnoongo ojwabi Nkolongwa muno.</para>
  <para style="q">Mwenga mamalongalela Angwana,</para>
  <para style="q">kutendekea ndela jabe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v"/>ngabalengela bandu bakwe kutenda mabakomboligwa</para>
  <para style="q">na kalekekeya mabaja gabe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>Nnoongo jwito jwambone na juna kia.</para>
  <para style="q">Ma auluya lumuli lu komboi nu kutumulikila,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>na kamulikilanga kuboke kumbengu boa abatamanga mukiwili cha kiu,</para>
  <para style="q">atulendele undela tujenda kwa tengela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Mwana ngakola, nukujendekea kummele nu uhuke. Ngatama papongoti mpaka pakilaya kipola ku bandu bu Kuisilaeli.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kubelekwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayo 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Machoba genia Nngwana Agosto ngabeka amuli ngapala bandu boa ba Loma babalangigwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kubalangigwa kwenio kiba kukutumbula, kingobu Kulenio akiba Nkolongwa jwa Nkoa gwa Silia. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Boa ngabajenda kukiandikicha kila mundu kukilambo chakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yusufu ngaboka kilambo cha Nazaleti ku Nkoa gwa Galilaya ngajenda kukilambo cha Beteleemu ku Nkoa gwa Yudea kwa belekwa Nngwana Daudi. Yusufu ajenda kwenio magambu akiba ju lungolo lwa Daudi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ngajenda kukiandikicha pamwe na Maliamu ojwakalagana kutolana nakwe. Kongo abi na ndumbo, <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apabakibanga Kubeteleemu, Maliamu lichoba lyakwe lyu kupotola ngiliika, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ngapoto mwana jwakwe ju litibo munulome, ngankwindia ngobo ngang'oneka mulijola elitendekiigwe kulele ng'ombe, magambu bapatangiteje nyumba jukuiki akageni.</para>
  <para style="s">Akapakachi kuboka kumbengu na akachungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Penia pakiba akachungi, batendanga kupokelana kilo kulende ilangwa yabe papipi na Betania.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:8">Akachungi balende ilangwa yabe</figure> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Akapakachi kuboka kumbengu ngabapitila, na kibumo cha Angwana ngichamulakila tii nde. Ngabajobokanga muno. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nambu Akapakachi kuboka kumbengu ngabalenga, “Makajogopangaje! Inkila kunetelanga nhwalo gwa mbone gukuala mojo muno kwa bandu boa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwa magambu lele kukilambo cha Daudi abelwike Nkomboi jwinu Kilisto Nngwana ojwalagila Nnoongo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nachenje kiba kiingi chinu mukikolela kilemba bikikwindiye ngobo pi lijola lya kulele ilangwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kingobu tu kikuta kikolongwa cha matyala kuboka kumbengu ngababe pamwe na Mpakachi kuboka kumbengu, ngabajembanga nu kunnumba Nnoongo,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>kulenga, “Kibumo ku Nnoongo kunani muno kumbengu,</para>
  <para style="q">na tengela padunia kwa bandu ababapaile muno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuboka tu akapakachi kujabu kumbengu, akachungi ngabalengelana, “Tujendange mpaka ku Beteleemu takalole lyenie libutulengile Angwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yenie ngababutuka mbelo, ngabankole Maliamu na Yusufu ngabammona mwana bang'onike pilijola lya kulele ilangwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Akachungi apabammona mwana, ngabalengela nhwalo gwa mwana ogubujoininge kwa akapakachi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Boa abajoininge genia ngabaomongwa na gaga agabalenga akachungi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Maliamu ngagakombakela na kugawachila muno genia goa mumojo gwakwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Akachungi ngababujanga kongo bakajemba nukunnumba Nnoongo kwa goa gabajoininge na kagabona ngibe tela anda apabakajoanga akapakachi ba kumbengu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana bampe liina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuboka pa machoba nane kingobu chukunhwina mwana ngikiika, ngabampe liina Yesu. Liina elyapanga mpakachi kuboka kumbengu tango na ndumboje.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bammeka ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Machoba apagaika ga mpapala gwa kujeguka Yusufu na Maliamu andi apipaligwe Mumalagilo ga Musa. Yene gabantolanga mwana mpaka Kuyelusalemu kummeka kwa Angwana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mumalagilo ga Angwana iandikigwe, “Kila ojwapakubelekwa ju litibo anda abi munulome apangigwa abe Chwapi ka Angwana.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Angweto uyo ngabajendanga kumpanga Lilumbo, ngunda ibena andaje mabunda mabena, andi apipaligwe mu Malagilo ga Angwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mangobu genia kukiba na mundu jumwe akemigwa Simioni ojwatama Kuyelusalemu, juna mojo gwa mbone akakamula agapala Nnoongo junakunnyali Nnoongo, ojwakiba akalendela ukomboi gwa Isilaeli. Uhuke jwa Chwapi akiba pamwe nakwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Alengiligwe nu Uhuke jwa Chwapi kube ajomokaje panga mmona Kilisto jwa Angwana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Alongaliligwa ni Uhuke jwa Nnoongo, Simoni ngajenda Kunyumba ja Nnoongo na achikibelei ba Yesu ngabanneta mwana kulubanja lwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo andi apipaligwe na Malagilo ga Musa, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Simioni ngampokela mwana mukuboko jakwe kongo akannumba Nnoongo, kulenga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Ngoe, Angwana, galenganile malagano ginu,</para>
  <para style="q">nhwotwile kunneka mpakachi jwinu ajende kwa tengela.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwa mio gango nubweni ukomboi oguboka kwinu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gwenio mupanganila bandu boa bubone,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lumuli ngulwamulikila bandu ba ilambo yenge,</para>
  <para style="q">nukuleta kibumo kwa bandu binu Kuisilaeli,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Awamundu na amamundu Yesu batela kuomongwa ilebe eyalongi Simioni. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Simioni ngabalumika nu kunnenge Maliamu, amamundu Yesu, “Mwana jonjono apambuligwe na Nnoongo kuoba nukombola bandu ba Kuisilaeli. Jwombe maba kiingi kuboka kwa Nnoongo echikibakatenda bandu ajingi bankana, <verse number="35" style="v"/>yene mawacho gabe agagikiite magabekigwa kipola. Kuechuka kupakueketa myojo jabe andi lipanga linakatema.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pakiba na nnondoli jumwe munkege mbuja nawele liina lyakwe Ana, biti Fanueli jwa kabi ja Asheli. Ngatama na angwanamundu kwa yaka saba tu kuboka apabatolana. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Paba mbuja jwa yaka makomi nane na ncheche. Abokiteje pa Nyumba ja Nnoongo, atela kupunga na kugongalela kilo na mui. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie, ngaika nnongi ngannumba Nnoongo, ngalenga nhwalo gwa mwana kwa bandu boa abakibanga bakalendela ukomboi gwa Kuyelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubuja Kunazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kingobu Yusufu na Maliamu pabajomola kamula genia goa agaamuligwe na Malagilo ga Angwana ngababujanga kachabe Kunazaleti ku Nkoa gwa Galilaya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mwana ngakola, ngabe na makakala, ngabe na malango muno na upeele gwa Nnoongo ngube pamwe nakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kakombo Yesu Kunyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kila chaka Achikibelei ba Yesu bakibanga na lukobo lwa kujenda Kuyelusalemu ku Mpapala gwa Pasaka. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kingobu Yesu apakiba na yaka komi na ibena, ngabajenda boa Kumpapala gwenio anda pulukiba lukobo lwabe. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Apaupeta Mpapala ngabatumbu mwanja gwa kubuja kachabe, nambu Yesu ngaigala ukwo, Kuyelusalemu panga manya achikibelei bakwe. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Bakitanga abi pamwe nabo mumwanja, ngabajenda lichoba tipi, kiboka chapenia ngabatumbu kumpala pala makalongo na mwaka maganjamundu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kwa magambu bammonangiteje, ngababujanga Kuyelusalemu kumpala. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Lichoba lya tatu, ngabankole Kunyumba ja Nnoongo akiba atamite panakati ja akaboli ba Akayahudi, akapenakia na kakonya ilebe. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Boa abajoininge malobe gakwe ngabaomongwa malango gakwe gambone. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Achikibelei bakwe apabammona ngabaomongwa. Amamundu, ngabankonya, “Manango, mboni mututei nyeniela? Awabinu na nenga tutelakumpala pala kwa mbwele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ngabajanga, “Mboni mangwetomwe umbala pala? Mmanyangitije, mbaligwa kube Kunyumba ja awabango?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nambu bamanyangitije kipola lijango lyenie.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu ngabuja pamwe nabo Kunazaleti, kwenio ngabajali. Amamundu ngabagabeka mumwojo genia goa. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kola nu kube na mojo gwambone nu kujendekea kupaligwa na Nnoongo na bandu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutangacha kwa Yohana Mmatichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ikiba chaka cha komi na nhwano cha utawala gwa Nngwana Tibelio, Pontio Pilato akiba ntawala jwa kilambo cha Yudea, Helode akiba ntawala jwa kilambo cha Galilaya, Filipo nnung'una jwakwe akiba nkolongwa jwa mikoa ja Itulea na Tilakoniti. Lusiana akiba nkolongwa jwa Abilene, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Anasi na Kayafa bakibanga akakung'i akolongwa. Kingobu chenie lilobe lya Nnoongo apalyanhwikila Yohana, mwana jwa Zakalia kwenio kupongoti. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yene Yohana ngajenda paali poa pulupakine lukemba Yolidani, ngabatangachi, kulenga, “Nnapange mabaja ginu nu kubatichigwa, Nnoongo mannekekea mabaja ginu.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Andi apiandikwe mukitabu cha Isaya ojwakiba nnondoli jwa Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="q">“Mundu achobe papongoti</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mapanganakie Angwana ndela jabe,</para>
  <para style="q">mmeke kipola mubapakupeta.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kila mabomba nhwelekeange,</para>
  <para style="q">kila kitombi ni litombi ipakubomoligwa.</para>
  <para style="q">Apapendite mapagololange</para>
  <para style="q">ndela ejipendite mmeke kipola.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na bandu boa mabubona ukomboi gwa Nnoongo!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi ngabaikanga kwa Yohana kupala babatichigwe. Yohana ngabalengela, “Mangweto machamajoka! Beneke abannengi nhwotwi kujepa lilaka lya Nnoongo eliika? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ntendange agalaya kutenda nnapangite mabaja. Makaachangaje kulenga nhwotwile kujepa lilaka kukuneme, Awabito ana Ulaimu, nannenge Nnoongo aotwi kagatenda mabwe aga gabe ingota yu Ulaimu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Libago libekigwe pamanhina ga mikongo, kila nkongo gwangapambika ubakupenguligwa nu kuleke pamwoto.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bandu ngabankonya, “Lele tutenda bole?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ngajanga, “Kila mundu ojwabi na ngobo ibele bammagulile jwangakola na ababi na ilyo balye pamwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na akatocha kodi ngabaikanga kupala babatichigwe, ngabankonyanga, “Aboli, twenga tutenda bole?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngabalengela, makatochaje kodi nduu kupeta apipaligwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Manjolinjoli gange ngagankonya, “Twenga tutenda bole?”</para>
  <para style="p">Benia ngabajanga, “Makatolangaje ilebe ya mundu jwajoa kwa makakala na kuntakiana jwajoa kwa kunkopekea. Nnyeketelange na nchala gwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bandu ngabatumbu kuhyobalela, ngabatumbu kuwacha na kukikonya iwechikine Yohana kube Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Penia Yohana ngabalengela boa, “Nenga nammatichanga kwa mache, nambu ojwapakuika nkolongwa muno kumbeta nenga. Mbaligweje ukulugula ngoji ya ilatu yakwe. Jwenio mammaticha kwa Uhuke jwa Chwapi na kwa mwoto. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jwenio akamwi kipalwe chakwe chukupete mapemba, aikongola mapemba nukubeka mukikokwe, nambu mapoi aitinia mwoto gwangaimika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kundela nduu Yohana ngatangacha Nhwalo Gwambone kwa bandu nakapala bileke ndela yabe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nambu Yohana ngankalapila Helode, nkolongwa jwa Nkoa, magambu akantola Helodia nhwana gwa nnuna gwakwe na akatenda ilebe ndu ibaja. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Helode ngakamwa kibaja muno kummeka Yohana mukipungo.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubatichigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuboka pa bandu boa kubatichigwa na Yesu uyo ngabatichigwa. Na apagongalela ku Nnoongo mbengu ngiekuka, <verse number="22" style="v"/>Uhuke jwa Chwapi nganhwulukila akiba andi njeba. Na lilobe ngilijoanika kuboka kumbengu, kulenga, “Mwenga Mamanango manampala. Undekuhalalila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Achikibelei ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-7">Matayo 1:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu apatumbula liengo lyakwe pukubonekana akiba na malenga andi yaka makomi matatu. Akiba mwana munalome bandu bakita Yusufu, ojwakiba mwana munalome jwa Heli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Heli akiba mwana jwa Masati, Masati akiba mwana jwa Lawi, Lawi akiba mwana jwa Meliki, Meliki akiba mwana jwa Yanai, Yanai akiba mwana jwa Yusufu, <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yusufu akiba mwana jwa Masilia, Masilia akiba mwana jwa Amosi, Amosi akiba mwana jwa Nahumu, Nahumu akiba mwana jwa Helisi, Helisi akiba mwana jwa Nagai, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nagai akiba mwana jwa Maasi, Maasi akiba mwana jwa Matasia, Matasia akiba mwana jwa Shemeni, Shemeni akiba mwana jwa Yoseki, Yoseki akiba mwana jwa Yuda, <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuda akiba mwana jwa Yoanani, mwana jwa Lesa, mwana jwa Zelubabeli, mwana jwa Shetieli, mwana jwa Neli, <verse number="28" style="v"/>mwana jwa Meliki, mwana jwa Adi, mwana jwa Kosamu, mwana jwa Elimadamu, mwana jwa Heli, <verse number="29" style="v"/>mwana jwa Yoshua, mwana jwa Eliezeli, mwana jwa Yolimu, mwana jwa Matati, mwana jwa Lawi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>mwana jwa Simioni, mwana jwa Yuda, mwana jwa Yusufu, mwana jwa Yonamu, mwana jwa Eliakimu, <verse number="31" style="v"/>mwana jwa Melea, mwana jwa Mena, mwana jwa Matasa, mwana jwa Nasani, mwana jwa Daudi, <verse number="32" style="v"/>mwana jwa Yese, mwana jwa Obedi, mwana jwa Boazi, mwana jwa Salimoni, mwana jwa Nashoni, <verse number="33" style="v"/>mwana jwa Aminadabu, mwana jwa Adimini, mwana jwa Alini, mwana jwa Esiloni, mwana jwa Pelisi, mwana jwa Yuda, <verse number="34" style="v"/>mwana jwa Yakobo, mwana jwa Isaka, mwana jwa Ulaimu, mwana jwa Tela, mwana jwa Naholi, <verse number="35" style="v"/>mwana jwa Selugi, mwana Leu mwana jwa Pelegi, mwana jwa Ebeli, mwana jwa Sala, <verse number="36" style="v"/>mwana jwa Kenani, mwana jwa Alufaksadi, mwana jwa Shemu, mwana jwa Nuhu, mwana jwa Lameki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>mwana jwa Masusela, mwana jwa Henoki, mwana jwa Yaledi, mwana jwa Mahalaleeli, mwana jwa Kenani, <verse number="38" style="v"/>mwana jwa Enoshi, mwana jwa Seti, mwana jwa Adamu, mwana jwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutegigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maluko 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka mulukemba lwa Yolidani kongo atweli Uhuke jwa Chwapi, ngalongaligwa nu Uhuke jwenio kujenda kupongoti. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwenio ngalondoligwa na Mmaja kwa machoba alubaini. Mangobu genia goa alije kilebe na yenie kiika kono ngajijoa njala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mmaja ngannengela, “Anda mwenga Mamwana ba Nnoongo, miliamuliche liganga ele libe nkate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngajanga, “Iandikigwe Mumajandiko Gachwapi, ‘Mundu alama kukulye nkate tuje.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kingobucho Mmaja ngantola Yesu mpaka kunani, ngannaya ingwana yoa ya padunia kukingobu chimwe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mmaja ngannenge, “Manampa kinala chi ingwana yoa ni ilebe yakwe yambone. Mbatite yoa yeno na anda mbai kumpe mundu jwajoa nhotwile ngweti kinala chu kumpe mundu jwajwoa ojunampambwile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yene yoa maiba inu mwe, anda unng'ongalile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Iandikigwe Mumajandiko Gachwapi, ‘Magongalela Angwana ana Nnoongo binu na mabegalela benia jika jabe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kiboka chapenia Mmaja ngantola Yesu mpaka kukilambo chu Kuyelusalemu, nukummeka kunani pulingo gwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo, ngannengela, “Anda mwe Mamwana ba Nnoongo mikileke pae kuboka pamba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gambu Majandiko Gachwapi galenga, ‘Nnoongo maamulicha akapakachi bakwe bannendele.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na kabe, ‘Mabantolanga mumaboko gabe, mikikipotekaje makongono ginu pamaganga.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngajanga, “Iandikigwe, makategaje ‘Angwana ana Nnoongo binu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mmaja apajomola kuntegela kila ndela nganneka oti mpaka kingobu echikipaligwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atumbu liengo lyakwe okwo Ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maluko 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kiboka chapenia Yesu ngabuja ku Galilaya, kiba na makakala ga Uhuke jwa Chwapi. Minhalo jakwe ngijijoanika ilambo yoa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Jwombe akiba akabola bandu. Mumajumba gabe ga kugongalela, kila mundu ngannumba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanigwa kwenio Kunazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bai Yesu ngajenda Kunazaleti, paali okwakolela, Lichoba lya Kupomolela ngajenda kunnyopa Nnoongo, ngajingi unyumba ja kugongalela andi lukobo. Ngajema kuchoma Majandiko Gachwapi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ngapoke kitabu cha nnondoli Isaya, ngakiatambula nu kupata paali apapaandikwe nyenie,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Uhuke jwa Angwana abi pamwe nanenga,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu atekumbambula nannetelange akawocho Nhwalo Gwambone.</para>
  <para style="q">Andekumbambula kutangacha nhwalo gwa mbone gwa kabeka bandu agabwa,</para>
  <para style="q">bangalolanga mabapata kulola kabele,</para>
  <para style="q">andekunduma kabeka agabwa ababoneligwa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>na ndangache kingobu kitenda kuika</para>
  <para style="q">Angwana ana Nnoongo mabakombolanga bandu bakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngaekelela kitabu, ngampe mpakachi, na ngatama. Bandu boa unyumba ja kunng'ongalela Nnoongo ngabannoleke muno. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Paali pamba pa majandiko gachwapi gapitile leleno andi apannyoine nakachoma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabanchalakicha boa na ngabaomongwa malobe gambone agalongile. Ngabalenga, “Bo, ojo nga mwana jwa Yusufu je?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Manyi kutenda mankombokela kulandanakia kongo, ‘Aganga mikilami mmene, na uyo kiboka chapenia maunengela nkamwa upamba pakaja ikobo uyaye einnaya pakachito. Uyo maunengela ukamula ilebe uyaye einnyoine ikamuligwe ku Kafalanaumu.’ ” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengelanga nyene, “Nnondoli kupataje ichima kukilambo chakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nambu mpenakiange, kweli pakiba na akaweligwa ajingi kukilambo cha Isilaeli mangobu ga Eliya. Mangobu mbengu pijitabigwa ula ngijikotoka koma kwa yaka itatu na nusu, ngapabe na njala ngolongwa muno kukilambo choa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ata nyeniela, Eliya atumigweje kwa mundu jwajoa kwenio Kuisilaeli nambu kwa nhweligwa jumwe tu ojwatama Zalefati kwenio ku kilambo cha Sidoni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kabe pikilambo cha Kuisilaeli pakiba na bandu ajingi abakiba bakatama kingobu cha nnondoli jwa Nnoongo Elisha pakiba na bina maloi ajingi. Ata nyeniela akibaje jwajotijola ojwajegwike nambu Naamani tu, mundu jwa kilambo cha Silia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Boa abakibanga ku nyumba ja kugongalela apabajoanga genia ngabachimwanga muno. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ngabajemanga, ngabanhuti panja pa kilambo chabe ngabampeleka kikitombi chibachengita kilambo chabe. Bapala bannekelange pae, <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngapeta panakati ja bandu, ngajabula.</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu juna nchepela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maluko 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kiboka chapenia Yesu ngajenda ku Kafalanaumu kilambo cha Galilaya, ngababolanga bandu Lichoba lya Kupomolela. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Boa ngabaomongwa muno kwa maboulo gakwe kwa magambu alongela kukinala. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na unyumba ja kugongalela mwakiba na mundu juna nchepela ngachobela muno, <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mwe! Yesu ju Kunazaleti! Mboni mutujingilila? Bo, nhwikila kutujomola? Nammanyi mwe mabeneke, mwe Machwapi ba Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngaukalapila nchepela gwenio, “Nkotoke! Mammoke mundu jwenio!” Nchepela nchapu gwenio ngugunng'wia mundu jwenio pae nnongi jabe, ngugummoka panga ntenda kilebe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabaomongwa, ngabalengelana, “Nga malobe ni ganga, gambu kukinala na makakala ajiamulicha michepela jiboke, na jenie kuboka!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Minhalo ja Yesu ngijijoanika paali poa ku nkoa gwenio.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamianga bandu ajingi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka ku nyumba ja kugongolela, ngajenda kachakwe Simoni. Akimundu akege Simoni bakiba atamwe muno, ngabannengela Yesu annamie. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu ngaika ngajema papipi na atamwe benia, ngakiamulicha kitamwe kimmoke. Kitamwe ngachaboka amama bala kingobucho ngabajinuka, ngabatumbu kabegelelanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lichoba apalyatipikaga, boa abakibanga na itamwe ijingi ngabaletanga kwa Yesu, jwombe ngabeka maboko gakwe panani ja kila mundu ngabalamianga boa. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Michepela ngijaboka bandu ajingi, ngabachobela, ngabalenga, “Mwe nga Mamwana ba Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabakalapilanga, bajeketelingije kulongela, magambu bamanyangite kube jwenio, nga Kilisto Nkomboi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atangacha mu nyumba ja kugongalela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maluko 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kindabi jakwe Yesu ngaboka na ngajenda pajika jakwe. Bandu ngabatumbu kumpala pala, apabammonanga, ngabapala kunhwibalikia akajabwaje kachakwe. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nambu jwenio ngabannengela, “Mpaka ndangache oti Minhalo ja Mbone ja Kingwana cha Nnoongo kuilambo yenge, gambu Nnoongo andumita kwa genia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ku yenie ngatangacha mumajumba gu kugongalela kila paali kuilambo yoa ya Yudea.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bakemanga akinapunji bakwe ba kutumbula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe Yesu akiba ajemite umbwega ja lilaba likolongwa lya Genesaleti, na bandu ajingi bakibanga bantindilinge batamangine, kupenikiyanga lilobe lya Nnoongo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngajibona mitumbwi mibele bakautila umbwega ja lilaba likolongwa. Akakoki benia bakibanga baulukinge, bakajoyanga mapelele gabe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngajingi muntumbwi gumwe ogukiba gwa Simoni, ngannyopa Simoni auegekeye mumache, kutaali kachoko na umbwega ja lilaba likolongwa. Ngatama, ngabola bandu ajingi kongo abi muntumbwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apajomolaga kubola ngannenge Simoni, “Unhendeche ntumbwi mpaka pa mache majingi, mwenga pamwe na akaganja binu makalekele mapelele ginu mpatange yamaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Simoni ngalenga, “Ananhota, tukachine ukoka yamaki kilo ndaa panga kupata kilebe. Nambu magambu nnengite, manekela mapelele.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuboka pa kutenda nyeniela ngabapatanga yamaki ndu, ata mapelele gabe ngagatumbu kueketeka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngabakemanga akajabe abakibanga muntumbwi gonge, baike bajangate. Ngabaikanga ngabatwelea yamaki mitumbwi joa mibele mpaka yakiba papipi kumilwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo apalola genia, ngakilikitila nnongi ja Yesu ngalenga, “Mmoke nnongi jango Angwana! Ne namundu bina mabaja!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni pamwe na akajakwe boa ngabaomongwa kwa kupata yamaki ndu nyenie. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pamwe na genia Yakobo na Yohana ingota ya Zebedayo bakibanga akakoki ajakwe Simoni. Yesu ngannenge Simoni, “Makajogopaje kuboke ngoe mamma makoki ba bandu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuboka pa kuuta mitumbwi jenia umbwega jililaba likolongwa, ngabailekanga yoa ngabankengama Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba ku kilambo chimwe cha kwenio, mundu jumwe juna maloi. Apammona Yesu ngagwe manguku ngannyopa Yesu, “Angwana, anda mpaile, unamie.” Kitamwe chenje chammeka mundu abonekane kube jwanga jeguka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu ngatondabeya luboko lwakwe, ngankunyula nu kulenga, “Mbala nnyeguke!” Kingobucho ngajeguka. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nganhwamulicha, “Makannengeje mundu jwajoa, nambu nnyende makakilae kwa akung'i, makapange lilumbo kwa magambu gu kujeguka kwinu andi apaamuliche Musa kukuchalakicha nnamite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu minhalo ja Yesu ngijijoanika kila paali, na bandu ajingi ngabakongana kupala bampenakie na kulamiigwa itamwe yabe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngajabula paali panga bandu ngagongalela kwenio.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu ojwapolite mmele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe Yesu akiba akabola, Mafalisayo bange na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa kuboka kuijiji yoa ya Ku Galilaya na Yudea na Kuyelusalemu bakibanga batamangite penia. Makakala ga Angwana gakiba pamwe na Yesu kwa magambu ga kalamia akatamwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bandu bange ngabaikanga, bampotwi mundu ojwapolite mmele, banng'onike pikindanda, ngabajiganga kummeka unyumba nnongi ja Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nambu kwa magambu ga bandu ajingi baotolingije kujingi unyumba. Penia ngabaobakela pikinyanga nu kumopo paali, ngabanhuluya mukindanda, ngabammeka nnongi ja Yesu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="5:19">Bandu ancheche bunhuluya mundu kupete pikinyanga</figure> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu apababona babi na imani ngolongwa, ngannengela mundu jweno, “Aganja, mabaja ginu galekekeigwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo ngabatumbu kukikonyanga, “Mundu ojo mene ojwalonge malobe gu matukano! Nnoongo jika jakwe ojwaotwi kulekekea mabaja!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu agamaanyi mawacho gabe, ngabakonyanga, “Kwa nike nhwachanga genia mumyojo jinu? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lyako elilibi kindema muno kulenga ‘Nnekekiigwe mabaja ginu, andaje kulenga, nnyeme nnyende?’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mbala mmanyange kutenda Mwana jwa Mundu akweti kinala cha kalekekeya bandu mabaja gabe padunia.” Penia ngannengela mundu jwenio ojwapolite mmele, “Nnamiigwe, ntole kindanda chinu, nnyabu kachinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kingobucho mundu jwenio ojwapolite mmele ngajema nnongi jabe boa, ngatola kindanda echakagolokela ngajabu kachakwe kongo kupeta kunnumba Nnoongo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Boa ngabaomongwa muno nu kubeganga na mbwele, Ngabannumba Nnoongo nabalenganga, “Lele tibweni ikobo!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kiboka penia Yesu ngapita panja, ngammona ntocha kodi jumwe liina lyakwe Lawi, atamite panyumba ju kutocha kodi. Yesu ngannengela, “Ungengame!” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lawi ngajema ngaileka ilebe yoa ngankengama Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Penia Lawi ngammeke Yesu mpapala nkolongwa kachakwe. Kati ja akageni pakiba nkengeni nkolongwa gwa akatocha kodi na bandu bange. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mafalisayo bange na akaboli bange ba Malagilo abakiba mu kikuta chabe ngabakokalekea akinapunji ba Yesu. Ngabakonya, “Mboni nnieganga na kunywe pamwe akatocha kodi na bina malemwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bandu banga kitamwe kumpalaje nng'anga, nambu abampala bina itamwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Inkila kakema bandu bamboneje balape malemwa, nambu bina malemwa balapange malemwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Konya nhwalo gu kupunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bandu bange ngabannenge Yesu, “Akinapunji ba Yohana Mmatichi kupunga kila kingobu nu kugongalela, ata akinapunji ba Mafalisayo batendanga uyo, nambu akinapunji binu kulye nu kunywe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Bo nkita abakokigwe kumpapala gukutola akege bapaligwa kupunga kingobu akoano babi pamwe na angweto? Kubeje! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nambu kingobu kipakuika akoano apabapakuboigwa kati jabe penia nga apabapakupunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela kabe kulandanakia kongo, “Abije mundu kubeka kibamba kiyono mungobo ng'ona. Anda atei nyeniela, mmanya kipakupachula ngobu jenie, kibamba cha ngobo nhyono kilandanaje na ngobo ng'ona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Abije mundu ojwajela divai nhyono mukitumba kigona, andatei nyenie divai nhyono jibakupachu kitumba chenie, divai jibakujitika, ni kitumba kipakupachuka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nambu ipaligwa divai nhyono kujela munhuku nnyono. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Abije mundu ojwapala kunywe divai nhyono kuboka pa kunywe ng'ona. Nambu alenga, ‘Ng'ona jela nga chwapi muno.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Konya nhwalo gwa Lichoba lya Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu akiba akapeta mumigonda ja ngano Lichoba li Kupomolela. Akinapunji bakwe ngabatumbu kupanyila miejo ja ngano, ngabakonyanga kwa maboko, nu kulyeganga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Gange Mafalisayo ngagakonya, “Mboni ntendanga ilebe yangapaligwa Mumalagilo Lichoba li Kupomolela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bo, nchomangitije patenda Daudi nakajakwe kingobu apabakiba na njala? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Daudi ngajingi unyumba ja Nnoongo, ngatola mikate ejibekigwe lilumbo kwa Nnoongo, ngalye na kapeganga akajakwe. Ipaligweje mundu kulyee mikate jenie nambu akakung'i tu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na Yesu ngajomo kulenga, “Mwana jwa Mundu akweti uwecho ata Lichoba li Kupomolela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu ojwapolite luboko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lichoba lenge lya Kupomolela, Yesu ngajenda kunyumba ji kugongalela ngabola. Kwenio akiba mundu ojwapolite luboko lwalelo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Akaboli bange ba Malagilo na Mafalisayo ngabapala pala lilemwa li kuntakiana Yesu, ngabannendela bammone akalamie mundu lichoba li Kupomolela. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngamanya mawacho gabe, ngannengela jwajo ojwapolite luboko, “Nnyinuke, nhwike nnongi jango.” Mundu jola ngajenda kujema penia. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Na nkonyanga, bo, Malagilo gito gutulenge kutenda nike Lichoba li Kupomolela? Kutenda kilebe chambone andaje kutenda kilebe changambone? Kunkombo mundu andaje kunkoma?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ngabalolekea boa, Yesu ngalenga, “Ntondabeya luboko lwinu.” Na jwenio ngatenda nyenie na luboko lwakwe ngululama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngabachimwa muno, ngababeka machabuli gukuntende Yesu mabaja.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apambula achandundame komi na abena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie Yesu ngajenda kukitombi kugongalela, ngakelukia kwenio kelu ndaa kunng'ongale Nnoongo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kindabi jaakwe ngabakemanga akinapunji bakwe, kati jabe ngabapambula komi na abena ngabatinanga liina achandundame, <verse number="14" style="v"/>Simoni ngantina liina Petulo na nnuna gwakwe Andulea na Yakobo na Yohana na Filipo na Batolomayo, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Matayo na Tomasi na Yakobo mwana jwa Alufayo na Simoni ojwamanyikana kube nkola kilambo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yuda mwana jwa Yakobo na Yuda Isikalioti ojwa anng'aluka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu babola bandu na kalamianga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayo 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu apauluka pikitombi pamwe na achandundame, ngajema pukongolou nkengeni nkolongwa gwa bandu pamwe na akinapunji bakwe bakiba penia. Nkengeni nkolongwa gwa bandu ukiba penia kuboke kuilambo yoa ya Kuyudea na Kuyelusalemu na kuboke kuilambo ya Tilo na Kusidoni, <verse number="18" style="v"/>ngabaika kumpenakia Yesu nu kulamiigwa itamwe yabe. Angweto abalaga ni michepela ngabaika kuboigwa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabapala kunkunyula, makakala ngagammoka na kalamianga boa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbaya nu kulaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayo 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngabatendebuki akinapunji bakwe, ngalenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mbaya mangweto mammi mahocho,</para>
  <para style="q">Kingwana cha Nnoongo nga chinu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mbaya mangweto mammi na njala ngoe,</para>
  <para style="q">magambu mmakujukuta!</para>
  <para style="q">Mbaya mangweto manhwechuka ngoe,</para>
  <para style="q">mpakuwekanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Mbaya mangweto apabanchimwa bandu, nu kunkana nu kuntukana nu kunkachapianga kwa magambu ga Mwana jwa Mundu! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nhwalalange mwojo nu kuina, gambu bammeki lilumbo likolongwa kumbengu. Akaokomundu batendanga uyo akalondoli ba Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nambu mpakulaga mangweto mammi nuloi ngoe gambu,</para>
  <para style="q">kingobu chinu chu kuala mojo kipetite!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mpakulaga mannyukutanga ngoe,</para>
  <para style="q">mannyoanga njala!</para>
  <para style="q">Mpakulaga maunhwekanga ngoe,</para>
  <para style="q">mpakuechukanga machoba genia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga mangweto mmoa babannumbali bandu, akaoko mundu batenda uyo kwa akalondoli buwangi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kapalanga akangondwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nambu nannenge mangweto maumbenakia, mapale akangondwa binu, matendelange gambone abanchimwanga, <verse number="28" style="v"/>malumikange upeele abammeka nhwilo na magongalelange abantendelanga mabaja. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Anda mundu amputite lijego limwe mantendebukie lenge. Anda mundu ampokite likoti linu, mannekele na nkogo gwinu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mampe mundu jwajote jola ojwannyopa kilebe na anda mundu ampokite kilebe chinu, makannengeje umuikie. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Matendelange bandu ajingi andi mwe gamagapala bantendele mangweto.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Anda mapailinge bandu abampalanga mangweto tu, bo, mpata lilumbo nike? Magambu bina malemwa bapalanga abapala! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Anda matendelinge gambone abantendelanga gambone mangweto, mpata lilumbo nike? Gambu bina malemwa batenda uyo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Anda makopelanga baba tu buhyobalela kunnepa, bo, mpata lilumbo nike? Gambu bina malemwa bakopelana bene akangweto jika, kupala babukiange andi ucho. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nambu! Gambu mangweto mapalange akangondwa binu na katendelanga gambone, makopelange panga hyobalela kunnepanga na lilumbo linu maliba likolongwa na mangweto mammaganga ingota ya Nnoongo ojwabi kunani. Kwa magambu jwenio jwambone kwa banga lumbo na akabaja. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mmegange na kia anda Awabinu pababi na kia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kahukumu bange</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayo 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Makahukumuje ajinu bandu na Nnoongo ahukumulangaje, makakoleeje bange na mangweto bankoleeje, malekekeange bange na Nnoongo mannekekea. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mapegange bange na Nnoongo mampa. Elo, mampatangage nukutwele kipemo, nukupolota mukuboko ginu choa chunhwotwi kamula, kwa magambu kipemo echimapemelanga bange ngucho echapakumpeme Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalandanakia kulenga, “Jwangalola kuotoje kuntandaya jwangalola nnyakwe, anda atei yenie, boa mabatumbukila mulibomba. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Napunji kapetaje aboli bakwe, nambu kila napunji anda ajomwile maboulo gakwe aba andi aboli bakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Mbona milibona lipandi elibi mulio lya nnunagwinu nambu kulibonaje lipalamandi elibi muliolinu mmene? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nhwotobo kunnenge nnuna gwinu, ‘Nnyeme nammoye lipandi mulio linu,’ nambu kulolaje lipalamandi elibi mulio linu? Mikitenda mambone mwe! Mmoye oti lipalamandi elibi mulio linu na penia manhwotola kulola kipola kuboya lipandi elibi mulio lya nnuna gwinu.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo umanyikana kwa ngokwa yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Nkongo gwambone kupambikaje ngokwa yanga mbone na nkongo mmaja kupambikaje ngokwa yambone. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kila nkongo umanyika kwa ngokwa eipambika. Bandu kutongoje mandombi munchonda na uyo bandu kutongolaje ngokwa ikemigwa zabibu mumikongo ja miba. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mundu jwambone apiya agabi gambone kuboka mumwojo gwakwe, na mundu mmaja apiya mabaja kuboka mumwojo gwakwe. Gambu kano jilongela agatwelile mumwojo gwa mundu.</para>
  <para style="s">Akachengi abena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayo 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Mboni ungemanga ‘Angwana, Angwana,’ na kongo kutendangaje ganannengelanga? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mundu jwa jwoa ojwaika kwango nenga kupenikia malobe gango nukuga agabala jwenio abi, <verse number="48" style="v"/>andi mundu ojwachengite nyumba jakwe ngaemba pae na kubeka kijemo panani piliganga. Lukemba ngulutwelela nukunga nyumba jakwe jigwije gambu achengiti gwicho. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nambu jwajwoa ojwajoine malobe gango nukuagabaje jwenio alandana na mundu ojwachengite nyumba jakwe panga kijemo. Lukemba apulu twelela mache ngagakunga nyumba jenie ngijigwe nu kubomoka, nuluindo lwakwe lukiba lukolongwa!”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mmanda jwa Kilongoi jwa nnenda jwa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayo 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu apajomola kabola bandu goa, ngajenda kukilambo cha Kukafalanaumu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwenio akiba kilongoi jwa akalenda ba Loma jwenio akiba na mmanda jwakwe ojwampaile muno, mmanda jwenio akiba ntamwe lola.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="7:2">Kilongoi jwa akalenda mya jimwe ba Kaloma</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kingobu kilongoi jwenio apajoa nhwalo gwa Yesu ngabatuma akananhota bange Akayahudi bajendange kunnyopa aike kunnamia mmanda jwakwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bandu benia ngabaika kwa Yesu, ngabampembela muno, kulenga, “Mundu ojo jwambone apaligwa muntendele agapala. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bapala bandu bito, putuchenga nyumba ji kugongalela jwenio ngatujangata muno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yenie Yesu ngajenda pamwe nabo. Akiba kutaalije na nyumba, kingobu kilongoi pabakinga akaganjamundu bannenge Yesu, “Angwana, mikikichumbuyaje, mbaligweje mwe nnyingi unyumba jango. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Uyo mbemalije ne kube nambone kwinu. Nambu nnonge lilobe tu mpakachi jwango malama. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ne uyo namundu nambi pae ji kinala cha akakolongwa, ngweti manjolinjoli pae jango anda nunhwamuliche jumwe, ‘Nnyende!’ Jwenio kujenda. Najonge, ‘Nhwike!’ Jwenio kuika, anda nunhwamuliche mpakachi jwango, ‘Nkamu kilebe chenje!’ Jwenio kamula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu apajoa genia, ngaomongwa, ngabatendebukila bandu ajingi abankengama, ngalenga, “Nanibonaje imani ngolongwa andi eje, Kuisilaeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akabanda apababujanga kachabe akilongoi ngabankole mpakachi jola alamite.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anhyoya mwana jwa nanhwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngajenda kukilambo chimwe echikikemigwa Naini, pamwe na akinapunji bakwe na nkengeni gwa bandu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apababandakila kuika panniango gwa kilambo ngabapiti bandu bapotwi lijenecha lya kakombo jumwe mwana jwa jiika jwa nanhwele. Bandu ajingi ba kilambo chene bakibanga pamwe na amama benia. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kingobu Angwana pabammona munkege jwenio, mwojo gwakwe ngutwele kia, ngannenge, “Makagutaje.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngaegele nu kulikunyula lijenecha na abapotolinge ngabajemanga, Yesu ngalenga, “Kakombo! Nannenge, nnyimuke!” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mundu jwenio ojwawile ngajinuka ngatumbu kulongela, Yesu ngankamuya kwa amamundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngababe nambwele ngabannumba Nnoongo, kulenga, “Nnondoli nkolongwa jwa Nnoongo apiti kati jito. Nnoongo aike kakombolanga bandu bakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Minhalo ja Yesu ngijijoanika mukilambo choa cha Yudea na kuilambo eibandakile.</para>
  <para style="s">Akapakachi kuboka kwa Yohana Mmatichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayo 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kingobu akinapunji ba Yohana apabannengela minhalo jenie joa. Ngabakemanga akinapunji akabele kati jabe, <verse number="19" style="v"/>na ngabakinga ka Angwana bakakonye, “Mwenga nga jwajo ojwalengigwa atenda kuika, andaje tupaligwa tunnende jonge?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kingobu angweto apabaika kwa Yesu, ngabalenga, “Yohana Mmatichi atukingite kwinu tunkonyekeye, ‘Mwenga nga jwajo ojwalengigwa atenda kuika, andaje tupaligwa tunnende jonge?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kingobucho, Yesu akiba bakalamianga bandu ajingi abapotekigwa ni itamwe ni michepela mibaja kabekanga bangalola ajingi balole. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mmujange, makannengelange Yohana agamagabweni nu kugajoa, bangalola kulola, nangwaba kujenda, bina maloi bajegwike, bangajoa kujoanga abawile kuyoka. Akahocho katangachilanga Nhwalo Gwambone. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mbaya mundu jwajo jwangabe na mbwele nane!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kubokapa akapakachi ba Yohana kujabula, Yesu ngatumbu kalengela bandu ajingi nhwalo gwa Yohana, “Pamajendanga kupongoti kummona Yohana mahyobalela kummona mundu nike? Andaje nnyeilinga kilibona linyai elipoge mboga? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lele nnyela kulola nike? Nnyela kunnola mundu ojwakwindite ngobo inakualala? Bandu abakwindanga andi yene kutama kukikikonja, batamanga mumajumba gi kingwana! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Unengelange nnyela kummona meneke? Nnondoli? Eluwe, kweli Yohana akiba kupeta nnondoli. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Jwenio nga ojwalengigwa Mumajandiko ga Chwapi. ‘Nnoongo alenga, mbakunkinga mmanda jwango, annongolele nu kumpanganakia ndela jinu.’ ” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu ngajonjakea, “Nannengelanga Yohana nga nkolongwa muno kupeta mundu jwajwoa ojwatamite padunia pano nambu ojwabi nchokochoko mukingwana cha Nnoongo nga nkolongwa muno kupeta Yohana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bandu boa pabannyoa jwenio, muno akatocha kodi ngubulumba gwambone gwa Nnoongo, benia nga abajeketela kubatichigwa na Yohana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu Mafalisayo na Akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabakananga kunnyali Nnoongo na yene ngabakananga kubatichigwa na Yohana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Ngoe nannandanakia na bandu ba bangoe? Balandine na nike? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Benia babi andi ingota itamangite pachoko. Kikuta chimwe kukilenge chenge, ‘Tunhwonalinge ng'oma ja mpapala gukutolana, nambu nhwinangitije! Tujembite minhambo jukokaleka nambu nng'utangitije!’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yohana Mmatichi ngaika akiba kupunga na anywije divai na mangweto ngamannenga, ‘Akweti nchepela!’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwana jwa Mundu aike atendakulyee na kunywee na mangweto ngannenganga, ‘Mannolekeange ojo kupojoka nu kulobela, nng'anja gwa akatocha kodi na bina mabaja!’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mwojo gwambone gwa Nnoongo ubonakine kube kweli kwa bandu boa abajeketile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kachakwe Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mfalisayo jumwe ngankoka Yesu kulyee chakulya kachakwe, na Yesu ngajingi kachakwe Mfalisayo jwenio, ngatama kulyee. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kukilambo chenie akiba munkege ojwakiba na mabaja. Apajoa Yesu atenda kulye kwa Mfalisayo, ngatola chupa cha alabasta. Chimauta ginakunungila, gabei ngolongwa muno. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ngajema papipi pa makongono ga Yesu, apeta kuguta na akanhwolokea manjochi mumakongono ga Yesu. Nukuungula makongono ga Yesu kwa nywili yakwe yu umutwe, ngannamba nu kumbakaya mauta genia. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kingobu Mfalisayo apagabona genia, ngaacha kumojo gwakwe, “Mundu ojo akabi nnondoli kweli kabi amanyi munkege ojo pabile na kabi amanyi ubaja gwabinago!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu ngalongela nukulenga, “Simoni, ngweti kilebe chu kunnengela.” Simoni ngannengela,</para>
  <para style="p">“Elo, Aboli unengele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Penia pakiba na bandu akabele abankopite uloi, Yesu ngatumbula, “Jumwe ngankopa uloi tela na nchala gwa myei makomi mabena. Na jonge tela na myei mibena. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Akibaje kati jabe ojwaotwi kunnepa jwenio, yene jwenio ngabalekekeanga boa akabele. Meneke kati ja akabele benia abapakapala muno Angwana?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Simoni ngajanga, “Kweli, jwajo ojwalekekeigwe ligambo likolongwa muno nga ojwabakapala muno Angwana benia.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngalenga, “Tela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngatendabuka kwa munkege nukunnenge Simoni, “Mamweni munkege jonjo? Ngaika pachinu pano, mambije mache gukuya makongono gango, nambu jonjo anyeliye makongono gango kwa manjochi gakwe nukunhwungula kwa nywili yakwe. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mwenga umbokije kwa kunamba nambu munkege jonjo akotwikije kunamba makongono gango tangu naikila. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mwenga umbakiije mauta umutwe jango, nambu munkege anyitile mauta gina kunungila mumakongono gango. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nannengelanga, munkege ojo alekekigwe mabaja gakwe nduu. Mammona ambala muno. Jwajwoa ojwalekekigwa kachoko, alaya kupala kachoko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngannengela munkege, “Mabaja ginu galekekigwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Bange abatamite pamecha ngabatumbu konyana benekangweto, “Jwenio mene mpaka aoto kulekekea mabaja?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngannengela munkege jola, “Imani jinu inkombwile, nnyabu kwa tengela.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Akikege abalongwaninge na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chenge kingobu Yesu ngapete kunnyini na kuijiji akatangacha Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Kingwana cha Nnoongo. Akinapunji komi na abele ngabalongwana pamwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Na akikege bange Yesu ababoyanga michepela mibaja na kalamianga itamwe, ngalongwana nabo. Benia nga Maliamu, ojwakemigwa Magidalena, jwenio ngaboigwa michepela saba, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yoana ahana ba Kuza, nkolongwa jwa maakama ga Nngwana Helode, Suzana na bange ajingi. Akikege benia bakiba bakapanga ilebe yabe kummegele Yesu na akinapunji bakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa mpandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bandu ngubunhwikalila Yesu kuboka kila kilambo, ngube nkengeni nkolongwa, Yesu ngabalenge kulandanakia kongo,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Mpandi ngajenda kumicha mbeju yakwe. Apamicha mbeju, yenge ngitola pandela na akapeta ndela ngabalebatanga na ijuni yu kunani ngionyola. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yenge ngitola pamaganga na kuboka pa kumalika ngijoma kukupelelwa mache. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yenge ngitola panakati ja miba, mikongo ja miba apimalika ngiibilikia. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yenge ngitola pulutope lwambone, ngimalika nukupambika mbonje mia.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngalenga, “Juna machikilo ajoe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Magambu ga kubola kwa kulandanakia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe ngabankonya Yesu kulandanakia kongo mana gakwe nike, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Mangwetomwe nkweti upeele gu kumanya chili ji kingwana cha Nnoongo. Bange kalengela kukulandanikia, mabalolanga nambu bibonaje nu kupenakia nambu bamanyaje.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela kipola kulandanakia kwa mpandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ganga nga mana ga kulandanakia, mbeju nga lilobe lya Nnoongo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mbeju eitoi pandela ilaya bandu abajoa lilobe lyenie, nambu Mmaja kuika kuliboya mumyojo jabe ibe bakaaminije na bakakomboligwaje. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mbeju eitoi pamaganga ilaya bandu abajoa lilobe lyenie nu kulipokela kwa kuala mojo. Nambu kujendekeje ukola nkati jabe, kuliamini kukingobu tu nambu magambu bakwetingitije mikega nkati jabe apakiika kingobu cha kulondoligwa, kuchipula. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mbeju eitoi pimikongo ja miba ilaya bandu abajoa lilobe lyenie, nambu kubanigwa na mbwele nu uloi nu kupala kukikonja, kuhyobale kwabe kujendekeje. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mbeju eitoi pulutope lwambone ilaya bandu abalijoanga lilobe lyenie ngibilikamula kwa mwojo gwambone na gwa kuaminika. Angweto kuimbalila mpaka kupambika ngokwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli oluekeligwe lidebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maluko 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Bandu kupambaje lumuli nukuekelela lidebe andaje kulubeka nhwina mwa kindanda. Nambu kulubeka panani putala kupala bandu apabakujingila unyumba balolange ndaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Chachoa chela chikiigwe kiba kubonekana pukongolou, na chachoa chela echikiekaligwe kiba kubonekana nu kupiigwa pukongolou.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mmegange maha apampenakianga, magambu mundu juna kilebe majonjekeigwa, nambu jwanga kola kilebe, na cha chache kichoko cha kweti kipakutoligwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Amamundu Yesu ni inung'una yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Penia amamundu na inung'una yakwe ngabanhwikili Yesu, nambu baotolingije kunhwegelela magambu bandu bakiba ndu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mundu jumwe ngannenge Yesu, “Amabinu na inuna inu bajemite panja, bapalanga bammone.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabalenge bandu boa, “Amabango na inuna yango nga ababilijoa lilobe lya Nnoongo nukuliagabala.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akiamulicha kimbonga kikotoke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe, Yesu ngaobake muntumbwi pamwe na akinapunji bakwe ngabalengela, “Tujomboke tujende kwiye ji lilaba.” Penia ngabatumbu mwanja. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Apabakiba undela Yesu ngabe lugono. Kingobutu upepo nkolongwa ngutumbu kuguguma, mache ngagatumbu kujingila nkati ja ntumbwi, boa ngababeganga mukulola. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabannyendela Yesu, ngabannyimuya ngabalenga, “Anahota, Anahota! Tutenda kuwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajimuka ngauamulicha upepo na mawimbi ga mache ngagakotoka, ngukube jee. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kibokachapenia Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Imani jinu jibiko?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu angweto ngabaomongwa nu kujogopa ngabalenga, “Ojo mundu nii? Awamulicha upepo na mawimbi gatenda nnyoa?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajibenga michepela mibaja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe ngabajendekea na mwanja gwabe, ngabaikanga kumbwani ku kilambo cha Kugelasi echikibendikine na kilambo cha Ku Galilaya, kwiye ja lilaba likolongwa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu apauluka kumbwani, ngakongana na mundu jumwe ojwabokela kunnyini juna nchepela. Kwa mangobu ndu mundu jwenio akiba akwinditije ngobo, akiba kutamaje kachakwe, nambu atama kulikabuli. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Apammona Yesu, ngaguta kulilobe likolongwa, ngakileke pae nnongi ja Yesu nukulenga, “Mwe ma Yesu ma Mwana ba Nnoongo Nkolongwa! Mpala nii kwango? Nannyopa makambotekaje!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Alenga genia magambu Yesu auwamulicha nchepela gwenio gummoke mundu jwenio. Kila kingobu ngugunng'wia, nu kuyenie bandu ngabannyigilila unyumba na maboko gakwe na makongono gakwe ngabantaba mitondolo na pingu, nambu ngaotola kueketa mitondolo na pingu na nchepela ngumutuya jwenio mpaka kupongoti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu ngankonya, “Lina linu mabeneke?” Jwombe ngajanga, “Lina lyango na ‘Lityala.’ ” Kwa magambu michepela mijingi jakiba jinhwikalile. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Michepela jenie ngijinnyopa Yesu akajipelekaje kulibomba lya kumambi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Paali penia pakiba na kipenga kikolongwa cha magolobe gatela kulye kukitombi. Penia michepela ngijinnyopa Yesu balekange jijingi kamagolobe, Yesu ngajeketela jijingi kamagolobe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Michepela ngijimmoka mundu jwenio ngijijingi mumagolobe. Kipenga choa cha magolobe ngikielela kuwelelo ngikijingi mulilaba ngagawe mumache.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Akachungi apabalola goa agapitile, ngababutukanga ngabajenda kalengela bandu nhwalo gwenio kunnyini na kumigonda. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bandu ngabaikanga kulola agapitile, ngabannyendelela Yesu, ngabammonanga mundu ojujimmokite michepela atamite papipi na Yesu, akwindite ngobo, abi na malango gakwe, ngabajogopanga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bandu ababikibweni kile chenie ngabalenge bandu bange nhwalo gu kulama kwa mundu jwenio. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bandu boa bikilambo cha Kugelasi ngababeganga na mbwele muno. Kuyenie ngabannyopa Yesu aboke kilambo chenie. Kuyenie Yesu ngaobakela muntumbwi, ngajabula. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mundu jola ojwaboigwe michepela ngannyopa Yesu, “Nanenga mbala kulongwana na mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu Yesu annyeketije, ngannengela, <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Mmuje kachinu makalanduli goa Nnoongo agantendile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bai mundu jola ngajabula ngapeta kutangacha kila paali kukilambo chenie ilebe yoa Yesu eyantendile.</para>
  <para style="s">Biti Yailo na munkege jumwe ojwakunywile ngobo ja Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu apabuja kingonu chenge cha lilaba, bandu ngabampokelanga, magambu boa bakiba bakannendaga. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Penia ngaika mundu ojwakemigwa Yailo, kilongoi jwa nyumba ji kugongalela. Ngakilikitila mumakongono ga Yesu, ngannyopa ajabule kachakwe kilongoi jwenio, <verse number="42" style="v"/>magambu mwana jwakwe munkege akiba jwenio tu, ojwakiba na yaka komi na ibele, akiba ntamwe lola.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu apakiba akajabula, bandu ngabanhwegelela kila kingonu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kati jabe pakiba na munkege jumwe ojwakiba ntamwe ncholo kwa yaka komi nibena, akiba ajomwile ilebe yakwe yoa eyakweti kwa akaganga, akibaje mundu ojwaotwile kunnamia. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio ngankengama Yesu unyuma, ngakunyula lubiniko lwa ngobo jakwe. Upo ngalama kitamwe chakwe cha ncholo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu ngakonya, “Bene abangunywile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Boa ngabalenga abije mundu ojwankunywile, Petulo ngalenga, “Angwana, bandu ajingi bantindilinge nu kunhwegelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngalenga, “Abile mundu jwangunywile, gambu nikibweni makakala gandekumoka.” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Munkege jola apalola aotwije kukiia, ngakilaya kongo akalendema kukujogopa, ngakigwia nnongi ja Yesu. Penia nnongi ja boa, ngannandulila Yesu magambu gukunkunyula na apaotwile kulama kingobucho. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Manango, imani jinu jinnamiye. Nnyabula kwa tengela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba tango akalongela, ngaika mundu jumwe kuboka kachakwe Yailo, kilongoi jwa kitebe chukunng'ongalela Nnoongo. Ngannengela, “Mwana jwinu awile, makachumbuyaje Abouli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu apajoa genia ngannenge Yailo, “Makajogopaje, nhwamina tu, jwenio malamage.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu apaika kachakwe Yailo, annengije mundu kujingi unyumba pamwe nabo, nambu Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo na achikibelei mundu ba kamwali jwenio. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Bandu boa bakibanga bakaguta nu ukokaleka kwa magambu gwa mwana. Nambu Yesu ngabalenge, “Makagutangaje, magambu mwana ajomwikije, abi lugono tu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Boa ngabanhwekanga kwa magambu bamanyangite kutenda mwana ajomwike. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngankamu luboko ngannengela, “Manango nnyimuke!” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Bwomi gwakwe ngubuja, kingobucho ngajimuka, Yesu ngabalengela bampe chakulya. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Achikibelei ba mwana ngabaomongwa muno, nambu Yesu ngabalengela bakannengeje mundu jwajoa jola genia agatendigwe.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bakinga akinapunji komi na abele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakemanga akinapunji bakwe komi na abena, ngabapeganga uwecho ni kinala chu kujibenga michepela na kalamianga akatamwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kibokachapenia ngabakinga bajendange kutangacha Kingwana cha Nnoongo na kalamia akatamwe, <verse number="3" style="v"/>ngabalengela, “Apannyendanga mwanja makapotoje kilebe, mumwanja gwinu, makapotoje nkungucho andaje nkoba andaje chakulya andaje uloi andaje makoti mikogo mibena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nyumba jajoa jabapakumpokela ntamanga mwenio mpaka apampakuboka kilambo chenie. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bandu anda bakanite kumpokela mangweto, mmokange pikilambo chenie na mpyatanga litukunda mumakongono ginu, kupala kuchalakicha kwabe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabatumbulanga mwanja kupetela kuijiji yoa, ngabatangacha Nhwalo Gwambone na kalamianga bandu kila paali.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuoya malango kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kingobu Helode, kilongoi jwa Galilaya, kujoa nhwalo gwa ilebe yoa eitendigwe, ngabe na mbwele, magambu bandu bange balenga, Yohana Mmatichi ate kuyoka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bange ngabalenga, Eliya apitile na bange ngabalengela jumwe kati ja akalondoli ba lolo ate kuyoka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Helode ngalenga, “Mutwe gwa Yohana ngununhweketa, nambu jonjo meneke jwanyoa nhwalo gwakwe?” Ngapala muno kummona Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aupe chakulya nkengeni nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Achandundame ngababujanga ngabannengela Yesu goa agabakamulinge. Yesu ngabatolanga, ngabajenda jikajabe kunnyini ku Betisaida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nambu bandu pabamanyanga kwajabwile, ngabankengamanga. Yesu ngabapokelanga, ngabalengela nhwalo gwa Kingwana cha Nnoongo, ngabalamianga abapailinga kulamiigwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lichoba apalyatumbula kutipika, akinapunji komi na abele ngabannyendelela Yesu, nukunnengela, “Matabukange bandu na kaleka bajendange kuijiji ya papipi bakapatange chakulya na pakugoloka, magambu pamba apatubile papongoti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabalengela, “Mapagange mangweto mwenga chakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Tukwetije kilebe nambu mikate nhwano tu na yamaki ibele tu. Pangaje tujende takaemele ilyo ya bandu boa bamba?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bakibanga penia akinalome elufu nhwano.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Malengelange bandu batamange ikuta ya makomi nhwano, makomi nhwano.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuboka pa akinapunji kutendanga yeniela, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngatola mikate nhwano na yamaki ibele, ngalola kunani kumbengu, ngannumba Nnoongo, ngametula mikate na ngatopolana yamaki ngabapeganga akinapunji bakwe babaganakie bandu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabalye nu kujukuta, ngabalokotanga makombo ga ilyo ngabatweleyanga ikapo komi na ibele.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo annyekete kube Kilisto Nkomboi ojwa pambuligwe na Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maluko 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe, Yesu akiba kugongalela jika jakwe, akinapunji bakwe ngabankengama. Ngabakonyanga, “Bo, bandu balenganga nenga na beneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ngabannyanga, “Bange balenganga mwenga nga Yohana Mmatichi na bange Eliya, bange jumwe jwa akalondoli ba lolo ba Nnoongo jwombe ayokite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Penia ngabakonyanga, “Mangwetomwe bo, nnenga ne nabeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo ngajanga, “Mwe nga Kilisto ojwalagiligwe, ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela nhwalo gwa kupotekigwa kwakwe na kuwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maluko 8:30-9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kiboka chapenia Yesu ngabakelebuya akinapunji bakwe bakannengeje mundu jwajoa nhwalo gwenio. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ngalenga, “Mwana jwa Mundu apaligwa kupotekigwe muno nukanigwa na akinanhota na akakung'i akolo na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa. Na apangigwa ukomigwa, nambu lichoba lya tatu mayoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ngabalengela bandu boa, “Mundu jwajoa anda apaile kungengama, apaligwa akikane mwene na atole nchalaba gwakwe kila lichoba na angengame. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Magambu mundu ojwapala kukombola bwomi gwakwe mwene mauoya, nambu mundu ojwaoya bwomi gakwe kwa magambu gango maukombola. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mundu apata nike anda aipatite ilebe yoa ya padunia kwa kukioya mwene? Mbemele kibije! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Anda mundu amone oni nenga na maboulo gango, uyo Mwana jwa Mundu ammonela oni mundu jwenio mangobu apapakuika ku kibumo chakwe na cha Awawa na cha akapakachi ba chwapi ba kumbengu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli, kutenda babi bange pamba bawegangaje panga bikibone Kingwana cha Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agalambuka kumiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maluko 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ikiba lichoba lya nane kuboka pa kulenga genia, Yesu ngabatolanga Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo kunani ja kukitombi kugongalela. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Apakiba akagongalela, kumiio kwabe ngukugalambuka na ngobo yakwe ngibe nhuu mbuu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kingobucho bandu akabele ngababe bakalongela nakwe. Bakibanga Musa na Eliya, <verse number="31" style="v"/>bapitilanga bakiba bina kibumo ngabalongelanga nhwalo gwa kiu chakwe Yesu chikipa kupitila Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Petulo na akajakwe bakibanga lugono, nambu ngabajimukanga ngabakibona kibumo cha Yesu na ngababona bandu abele abakiba bajemangite pamwe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bandu bala pabakiba bakajabula, Petulo ngannengela Yesu, “Anhota, ialile bole twenga tube pamba! Matuchenga iteba itatu, chimwe chinu, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.” Kweli akiba amanyije chalongela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Petulo apakiba tango akalongela, kingobucho liunde ngilipitila na kaekelela ni kiwili chakwe, na liunde lyenie apalyaekelela akinapunji bala ngabajogopanga muno. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lilobe ngilijoanika kuboka muliunde mola, “Jonjo nga Manango ojunampambwile, mampenakiange.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuboka pa lilobe ukotoka, Yesu ngabonekana abi jikajakwe. Akinapunji ngabatamanga nu kwa nhwalo gwenio, na mangobu genia bannengije mundu jwajotijola minhalo jenie jibijibwenangite.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajibenga michepela ejinnyingile kakombo jumwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maluko 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Malabo jakwe Yesu pamwe na akinapunji bakwe pabauluka kuitombi, nkengeni gwa bandu ngukongana na Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mundu jumwe ngachobela pankenga gwenio, “Aboli! Ndendakunnyopa, munnolekeye manango kabe manango jwa jika. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Michepela apajinhwikilila, kingobu tu kuntenda achobele, na kummeka kiinduindu na liululu kumpita munkano, jijendekea kumpoteka muno, kunneka chokweje! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nganajopanga akinapunji binu buboyange, nambu baotolingije.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Mangweto mabandu banga imani! Ndama namangweto mpaka lii? Nanhwimbilila mpaka lii? Mannetange mwano pamba?” Kiboka chapenia ngannengela mundu jola, “Munnete mwana jwinu pamba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mangobu mwana jwenio panhwikilila Yesu, nchepela gola ngugunng'wia pae na kummeka mwana jola kiinduindu. Nambu Yesu ngaukalapila nchepela gwenio, ngannamia mwana na kape awamundu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabaomongwa na uwecho nkolongwa gwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela kabele nhwalo gwa kiu chakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Bandu bala pabakiba tango bakaomwanga minhalo joa echikitendigwe na Yesu, ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Makalibililangaje echinannengela! Mwana jwa Mundu ajenda kubekigwa mumaboko ga bandu.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nambu akinapunji bamanyingitije mana ga kulenga kwenio. Nhwalo gwenio gwakate kuiigwa kwa akangweto ibe bakamanyangaje na bombe batela kujogopanga kunkonya nhwalo gwenio.</para>
  <para style="s">Beneke ababi ananhota?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ngukupitila kijonga kati ja akinapunji bala nhwalo gwa meneke kati jabe ojwabi munanhota muno. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya mawacho agabawacha mumyojo jabe, penia ngantola mwana nchokochoko, ngammeka papipi jakwe, <verse number="48" style="v"/>na ngabalengela, “Mundu jwajotijola ojwampokela mwana andi jonjo ku liina lyango, amboke nenga na jwajotijola ojwamboke nenga, bapoke abandumite. Magambu jwajoa ojwabi nchokochoko kupeta boa kati jinu jwenio nga nkolongwa kupeta boa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwangankananga mangweto abi kingonu chinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maluko 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yohana ngalenga, “Ananhota, tumweni mundu jumwe akaboya michepela kwa liina linu natwenga ngutujiga kunkanakia kwa magambu jwombe akibaje munkenga gwito.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngannengela, “Makankanakiaje magambu mundu jwangankananga mangweto abi kingonu chinu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kilambo chimwe cha Akasamalia bakananga kumpokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kingobu apakibandikila cha Yesu kutoligwa kujenda kumbengu, ngajenda Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ngabatuma akapakachi balongolelange, bombe ngabajenda ngabajingilanga kukijiji chimwe cha ku Samalia bampanganile kila kilebe. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Nambu bandu ba kwenio bapalangitije kumpokela, kwa magambu ajenda Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Bai akinapunji bakwe kina Yohana na Yakobo pabagabona genia, ngabalenga, “Angwana mpala tukeme mwoto uwike kuboka kumbengu gwatiniyange?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yesu ngabatendebukia, ngabakalapilanga. Majandiko gange gajonjakie, ngalenga, “Mmanyangiteje nkweti mojo gani, magambu Mwana jwa Mundu aikila ukoma banduje, nambu kakombola.” <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kibokachapenia Yesu na akinapunji bakwe ngabajenda kukijiji chenge.</para>
  <para style="s">Abapaligwa kube akinapunji ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayo 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Pabakiba bakajendaga undela, mundu jumwe ngannengela Yesu, “Mbakunkengama kila kumpakujenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Mabwea gakweti nduka ni ijuni yu kunani ikweti uhui, nambu Mwana jwa Mundu akwetije paali pu kubeka mutwe gwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Ngannengela mundu jonge, “Ungengame.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu jwombe ngalenga, “Angwana, nanji uneke nyende oti nakachike awabango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Milekange mitui ichike mitui mijakwe. Mwenga nnyende makatangache Kingwana cha Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Na mundu jonge ngannengela, “Ananhota manankengamage, nambu unyeketele nakatabuke bandu ababi kachango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Jwajoti ojwakamu lijembe kulema na kongo kulola unyuma kupaligwaje ku Kingwana cha Nnoongo.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bakinga akinapunji makomi saba na ibena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka pa genia Angwana ngabachagu bange makomi saba na mabele, ngabatuma akabele abele, bannongolele ku kila kijiji na paali apapala kujenda. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngabalengelanga, “Mauno nga majingi nambu akauni akachoko. Nnyopange kwa akola nng'onda bakinge akauni munng'onda gwakwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lele nnyendange! Nankinga mangweto andi mambelele apagajenda kati ja mamei. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Makapotoje mumwanja gwinu nhwuku guloi andaje nkoba ni ilatuje, makampataje mundu abali undela. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Anda nnyingilinge nyumba jajoa, ntumbula kulenga, ‘Tengela jibe munyumba jenje!’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Anda mundu jwajipala tengela ampokilinge, nnyeketalange ntamange kwa jwenio, anda abije mundu ojwapakumpokelanga, tengela jinu jibakummuji mmene makangweto. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ntamanga unyumba jenie na nniagange na nnywegange ibampeganga, gambu ojwakamu maengo apaligwa kulepigwa lipungu lyakwe. Makajendangaje kingobu nyumba jenje kingobu nyumba jaje. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Anda nhwikilinge pikilambo chochoa na bandu bampokelinge, nnyegange kila echibapa kubeka nnongi jinu, <verse number="9" style="v"/>nnamiange akatamwe pikilambo chenie na malengelange bandu, ‘Kingwana cha Nnoongo kibandakile kwinu.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nambu anda nnyingilinge kukilambo chochotiche, changampokelanga, mmokange, pampetanga undela jabe nnenganga, <verse number="11" style="v"/>‘Ata litukunda mumakongono gito li kilambo chinu tilipyata kwa magambu ginu. Nambu nkombokele, kutenda Kingwana cha Nnoongo kibandakile!’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, lichoba lya hukumu, Nnoongo malaya kia kwa bandu ba Kusodoma kupeta kukilambo chenie!</para>
  <para style="s">Ilambo yanga amini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayo 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kulaga mwe! Kilambo chu Kukolasini, kulaga kilambo chu Kubetisaida! Gambu ikobo yanatenda kachinu ilaigwe kukilambo chu Kutilo na Kusidoni bandu bakwe kabi bakwindangite ngobo ya magunia nu kutama pamaliu kulaya balapite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ata nyeniela, lichoba lya hukumu mangwetumwenga mampatanga hukumu ngolongwa kupeta ja bandu ba Tilo na Sidoni. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na mwenga, ma Kafalanaumu, bo, mikitondabeya mpaka kumbengu? Manhwuluigwa mpaka kumambi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Ojwampenakianga mangweto, ambenakia nenga na ojwakana kumpokelanga mangweto, akana kumboke nenga. Na ojwakana kumboke nenga akana kapoke abandumite.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubuja kwa bandu makomi saba na mabele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwenakandae makomi saba na abele ngababujanga babilangite na tengela, ngabalenga, “Angwana, ata michepela jitujoine apatujibengita kwa liina linu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nginilibona Lichetani apilikiba likaagambuka andi njai kuboka kumbengu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mpenekiange, nampilangite kinala chu kulebata majoka na makalambwa, ni kinala chu kuibila makakala ga mmaja. Kibije echikipala kummengwa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu makaalalilangaje kwa magambu ja michepela jinnyoanga, nambu nhwalalilange kwa magambu maina ginu gaandikwe kumbengu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kualalila kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie Yesu kongo atweli uwecho gwa Uhuke jwa Chwapi, ngalenga, “Nannumba mwe Mawawa, Mangwana bu kumbengu na padunia! Magambu ilebe yene maiite bandu bunuwecho na bina malango, ngamaekulila akinangota. Elo, Awawa yene nga pampaile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Awabango bangamwiye ilebe yoa. Abije ojwammanyi Mwana nambu Awawa, na abije ojwabamanyi Awawa nambu Mwana na jwajo ojwapai Mwana kunhwekulila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kibokachapenia Yesu ngabuja kwa akinapunji bakwe, ngabalengela, “Mbaya bandu ababagabona gamagabona mangweto! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli, akalondoli ndu na akangwana ngabapala kulola genia gamagabona mangweto, nambu bakagabonaje, nu kugajoa genia gamagajoa mangweto, nambu bakagajoaje.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa mundu chwapi jwa ku Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mundu ojwamanyi gwicho Malagilo ga Musa, ngajiga kuntega Yesu. Ngakonya, “Aboli, ndendabole kupala mbate bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga jwombe, “Iandikigwe bole Mumalagilo? Nhwelibo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mundu jo ngannyanga, “ ‘Mapale Angwana ana Nnoongo binu kwa mwojo gwinu gwoa na kwa kiuke chinu choa na kwa makakala ginu goa na kwa malango ginu goa, na mumpale nndami nnyinu anda pimikipala mmene.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Tela! Ntendi nyeniela, namwe mannama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nambu mundu ojwamanyi Malagilo ngapala kukiingikia mwene kutenda jwa mbone, penia ngankonya Yesu, “Andami ajango ngabeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Mundu jumwe akiba kuboka Kuyelusalemu kujenda ku Yeliko. Apakiba undela, ngajingiligwa na akajibi ngabampoka uloi jakwe na kumputa, ngabanneka agolwike penia papipi nu kuwe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ngapitila nkung'i akiba akapeta ndela jenie, nambu apammona mundu jwenio, ngapeta umbwega. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Unyaela mundu jwa lungolo lwa Lawi uyo ngapeta penia, ngammona, ngapeta umbwega. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nambu mundu jwa ku Samalia ojwakiba namwanja ngaika penia apakiba mundu jwenio na apammona ngammone kia. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ngannyendelela, ngammeka mitela mmaganga gakwe kwa kunnyela mauta na divai na kagatabalila, kibokachapenia nganhwobakea panani pa liponda lyakwe, ngampeleka kunyumba jimwe ja akamageni nganwaya. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Malabo jakwe ngapanga uloi tela na nchaala gwa machoba mabena, ngabalengela, ‘Mannwae mundu jonjo, na uloi gonge ogubakutumika manannepa apambakubuja.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kingobucho Yesu ngankonya, “Kati jabe akatatu, ngajwaako ojwalaite kube andami bakwe jwajo ojwajingiligwe na akajibi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mundu ojwamanyi Malagilo ngannyanga, “Ngajwajo ojwammoni kia.” Yesu ngannengela, “Nnyende makatendi unyaela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ukaja kwa Malita na Maliamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe apabakibanga undela, ngabaika kukijiji chimwe na munkege jumwe ojwakonda Malita, ngampokela kachakwe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Malita akiba nnombo jwa Maliamu, jwenio ngabatama papipi na Angwana kupenekia maboulo gakwe. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nambu Malita akiba akakamula maengo majingi, bai ngannyendele Yesu ngannenge, “Angwana mboni kujalije nyeniela alombo bango banekite ngamu maengo jika jango? Bai malengele, banyangate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nambu Angwana ngabannyanga, “Malita, Malita, nnolalola nukuchumbuka kwa ile ijingi, <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nambu kilebe chimwe tu chambone, Maliamu achagwile kilebe chambone chenie abije mundu ojwapala kumpoka.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu abola nhwalo gwa kugongalela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe Yesu akiba pa ntemela kugongalela. Apajomola kugongalela napunji jwakwe jumwe ngannengela, “Angwana, tutenda nnyopa mutubole kugongalela anda Yohana Mmatichi apababola akinapunji bakwe.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengelanga, “Apanng'ongalela, nnengange nyeniela,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Awawa,</para>
  <para style="q">lina linu lya chwapi likoliigwe,</para>
  <para style="q">Kingwana chinu kiike.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taji mutupe chakulya chito cha kila machoba.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mutulekekeye mabaja gito,</para>
  <para style="q">andi twenga patalekekeya boa ababutulemwite.</para>
  <para style="q">Mukutubekaje mumitambo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kibokachapenia ngabalengela, akinapunji bakwe, “Tulenge nnyito jumwe akweti aganja kachakwe kilo puwiku, ngannyopa, ‘Aganja, nanji ungopele mikate mitatu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwa magambu aganja bango bambetile kachango ababi na mwanja nanenga ngwetije chakape!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Jwombe akiba unyumba kabi bajangite, ‘Makanjumbuyaje! Tayali nyigile nnyango. Nenga na ingota yango tugolwike, nhwotije kujimuka nampe.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kweli, iganukube ajimukaje kumpe mikate kwa magambu ga mundu jwenio nng'anja mundu, nambu kwa magambu mundu jwenio akwetije oni ja kujendekea kunnyopa, majimuka kumpe chachotichela chakipala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Na yene, nannenge nnyopa tu na mangweto mampata, mpalapala tu namangweto mamikibona, nng'omba tu oti namangweto mabanyogolelanga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gambu jwajwoa ojwajopa kupata, ojwapalapala makibona na ojwagomba oti mabannyogolela. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bo, abi mundu kati jinu anda mwana gwakwe jwapa kumpe lijoka papakujopa chamaki? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Anda ajopite liyaja, bo, mabampa kipelele? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Anda mangweto mammi mabaja mmanyangite kipeganga ingota inu ilebe yambone, awabinu bu kumbengu mabampaganga muno, mabapaganga Uhuke jwa Chwapi akangweto abannyopanga!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maluko 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe Yesu aubenga nchepela oguntei mundu jumwe kube bubu. Bai nchepela gwenio ngummoka, mundu jwenio ngaotola kulongela, bandu ajingi ngabaomongwa, <verse number="15" style="v"/>nambu kati ja bandu bena ngabalenga, “Ajibenga michepela kwa uwecho gwa Belizebuli nkolongwa ju michepela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bandu bange, ngabajiga kuntega ngabampala alaye iingi ibonekane anda kweli akiba nu uwecho kuboka kumbengu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu, akiba amanyi mawacho gabe, ngabalengela, “Kingwana chachotichela echikibaganike ikuta ikuta eigambana, mangobuje kupela, na nyumba jajoa janga chikichana kingobuje kujebelea. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Anda Lichetani likikana lyene, Kingwana chakwe kijemabo? Nnengangabo, menga michepela kwa makakala ga Belizebuli? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Anda nubenga nchepela kwa makakala ga Belizebuli, ingota yinu ijibenga michepela kuwecho gwa beneke? Kwa magambu genia nga pabapakunhwukumu mangweto kube makawangi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu anda nijibenga michepela kwa makakala ga Nnoongo, bai mmanyange Kingwana cha Nnoongo kiike kwinu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mangobu mundu juna makakala, anda abi na chilaa apalendela nyumba jakwe, ilebe yakwe yoa iba tengela. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nambu anda aike mundu jonge juna makakala muno kunnyingilila na kunhwotola, jwenio apakapoka chilaa yabe eibahyobalela nu kutola ilebe yoa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mundu jwajwoa jwanganonda nenga, angana nenga, na jwajoa jwangakongola pamwe na nenga, atenda kuambugana.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubuja kwa nchepela mmaja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kingobu nchepela pugummoka mundu, ujenda papongoti kupala paali pu kupomolela. Anda nukupataje akilengela mwene anda mbataje paali pa kupomolela, ‘Mambuja kachango kumokitage.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apabuja nu kujikolela nyumba jela jipyagiligwe na jibi chwapi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Aijenda kujitola jengi michepela saba, jinamakakala kupeta jwenio, na jwenio kuika kunnyingilila mundujo na ali ja mundu jwenio jibakube mbaja kupeta pitumbula. Ngoe alijakwe jiba mbaja kupeta patumbulaga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Laa ja kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba akalenga genia, munkege jumwe ojwakiba munkenga gwa bandu, ngalenga kwalilobe likolongwa, “Mbaya munkege ojwampotwile mwenga nu kujonga mabele gakwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngajanga, “Mbaya muno abilijoa lilobe lya Nnoongo nukulijali.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bandu bapalanga kibona ikobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bandu pabajonjekeka kuika, Yesu ngabalengela, “Bandu bangoe akabaja. Bipala iingi, nambu bapatangaje kiingi chachoa nambu cha Yona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ibi tela na apikiba kwa nnondoli jwa Nnoongo Yona akiba kiingi kwa bandu ba ku Ninawi, unyae Mwana jwa Mundu apapakube kiingi kukingolo chenje. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Linyongolo lya kubanda mapitila mangobu bandu bamba pabapa kuhukumigwa, magambu jwenio ngaboka kachakwe kutaali ngaika kupenikia gambone ga Solomoni napamba pabi nkolongwa kupeta Solomoni. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bandu bi kilambo chu Kuninawi mabapitila kingobu cha hukumu, na angweto buluhukumula lungolo londo kube na malemwa. Gambu bandu ba Kuninawi balapanga kwa matangacho ga Yona, na pamba abi Nkolongwa kupeta Yona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa mmele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Abije mundu ojwapamba lumuli nukuluekelela lidebe andaje kuluekelela lidebe nambu kulubeka panani putala ibe bandu abajingila unyumba bapatange kulola ndaa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lio linu ngu lumuli lwa mmele, lio linu anda libi lyambone mmele gwinu gwoa mauba mulumuli, nambu anda lio linu libou mmele gwinu uba mulubendu tetele. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mmeke gwicho lumuli olubinkati jinu lwakabeje pulubendu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Anda mmele gwinu gwoa ubi na lumuli, nukubeje paali pina lubendu, mmele gwenio maung'ala kwambone andi lumuli pulumulika mmele.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bagambanga Mafalisayo na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba akalongelaga, Mfalisayo jumwe ngankoka kujenda kachakwe kulye chakulya. Yesu ngajenda, ngatama kulye. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mfalisayo ngaomongwa kummona Yesu akalya panga kuya oti. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Angwana ngannenge, “Mangwetomwenga, Mafalisayo nyeleyanga ikombe na yani panja tu, nambu nkati ntwelelinge upoki na ubaja. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Makajinga mangweto! Bo, ojwatenganiche panja nga ujwoje ojwatenganiche nkati? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mpangange malumbo kwa akaocho ilebe eibi nkati, na yenge yoa maiba chwapi kwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Nambu mpakulaga Mafalisayo magambu ntochanga bandu malumbo mpaka maamba gu kutimbi yakulya, nchicha na maamba gange na kongo kuagabaje katende gambone bandu na mapalano ku Nnoongo. Ipaligwa kiagabala ilebe yenie na yenge.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga Mafalisayo kwa magambu mpalanga kutama nnongi paali pina ichima unyumba ju kugongalela na kumpata abali kwa ichima muchoko. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mpakulaga, kwa magambu mmi andi makabuli gangabeka alama, bandu kulebata panani jakwe kumanyangaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Jumwe ojwamanyi malagilo ngannengela, “Aboli, malobe ginu gutukachapia na twenga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Na mangwetomwe uyo mpakulaganga makaboli ba malagilo! Matwekanga bandu miigo jangapotoleka, kongo mmene mangweto kutondobeaje maboko ata kachoko kajangatanga. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mpakulaga mangweto! Kwa magambu nchengele makabuli ga akalondoli ba Nnoongo bombe akaokobinu ngabakomanga. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yene nchalakichanga mmene kutenda makangwetumwe nnyeketela pabatendanga genia akaokabinu, benia ngabakomanga akalondoli, na mangweto nchengele makabuli gabe. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Malobe ga Nnoongo galenga, ‘Manapelekelanga akalondoli na achandundame, nambu bange mamakomanga, na bange mamapotekanga.’ <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yene bandu ba ngoe bapa kuhukumigwa kwa kakomanga akalondoli ba Nnoongo makihukumigwa kwa magambu ga myai ja akalondoli boa ejijitinike tangu kutumbu apaja panganigwa dunia, <verse number="51" style="v"/>kuboka komigwa kwa Abeli mpaka komigwa kwa Zakalia jwombe akomigwa panakati ja pachwapi ni kitembe chukupangi lilumbo. Kweli nannenge lungolo londo maluhukumuligwa kwa genia goa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga akaboli ba malagilo, kwa magambu nng'oyanga lupungulo lwa nniango gwa malango gu kummanya Nnoongo. Mmene makangweto kujingije na maibilikia abapalanga kujingila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Apakiba akaboka penia, Mafalisayo na akaboli abagamanyi malagilo ngabatumbu kutega kwa kunkonya machwali majingi, <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kuntega kupala alonge malobe gangambone banyonje.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kakanali bakabeje na akandendemundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayo 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Maelufu ga bandu ngabakongananga pamwe mpaka kulebatana, Yesu ngabalenge oti akinapunji bakwe, “Mme maha na maboulo ga Mafalisayo ga uwangi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kila chikiekeligwe kiba kuekuligwa, na changamanyikana makimanyikana. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Uyo goa agannongi pulubendu, bandu mabagajoa pukongolou, na gowa agannyojela kingobu milyango mujigale, magatangachigwa pikinyanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Ojwa paligwa kujogopeka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayo 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Nannenge makaganja bango, makajogopaje abakoma mmele, kubapenia kuotolangaje kutenda chenge kilebe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mananangila ju kunnyogopa, mannyogopange Nnoongo jwombe kuboka pukoma, akweti kinala chu kunneke kumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa. Nhwamina ne, jwenio nga ju kunnyogopa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Imanyakine kube iyebele nhwano iyuchigwa kwa yumuni komi, yeneje? Nambu Nnoongo kikilibalije wala chimwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu ata nywili ya mutwe gwinu aibalangigwe yoa. Yene makapwelelaje, mangweto mambone kupeta iyebele ijingi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kunnyeketela na kunkana Kilisto Nkomboi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayo 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19-20">Maluko 10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Nannenge kweli, kila mundu ojwanyeketela pabandu kutenda jwenio nga jwango, Mwana jwa Mundu mannyeketela nnongi ja akapakachi ba Nnoongo kutenda mundu ojo nga jwango. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nambu mundu jwajotijola ojwambakungana nnongi ja bandu, jwombe makanaligwa nnongi ja akapakachi ba Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Jwajotijola ojwalenga lilobe lyu kunkana Mwana jwa Mundu malekekiigwa, nambu ojwantukana Uhuke jwa Chwapi alekekiigwaje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Pabampeleka mangweto nnongi ja nyumba ja kugongalela nnongi ja akatawala na bina kinala, makapweleje kilebe champakulongela andaje champakulongela. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Magambu Uhuke jwa Chwapi, kingobucho mammola mangweto chu kulongela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na Nnyinga juna uloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mundu jumwe ojwakiba pamwe na bandu bala ngannenge Yesu, “Aboli, mannengele nunugwango tubagane ulichi ugubutuleki Awawa bito.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nganyanga, “Maganja bango, beneke abambi ne kube nahakimu ba ilebe andaje nachikachani panakati jinu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngabalengela boa, “Mmagange maha na tama, gambu bwomi gwa mundu uhyobale kube ni milebe eiyakwetije, wala uloi guba kube.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngabalengela kulandanakia gongo, “Pakiba na mundu juna uloi ojwakweti nng'onda guipambike ilyo ndu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mundu jwenio ngawacha kumojo gwakwe, ‘Ndenda bo nenga? Ngwetije paali pa kubeka mauno goa gano? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ngakilenge mwene, ndenda yene,’ ‘Momolana ikokwe yango nukuchenga kikokwe kikolongwa muno, mwenio mameka ilyo yango yoa ni ilebe yango. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuboka penia nikilengela namwene. Ngoeno nkweti lupambo lwa kutumia kwa yaka na yaka. Kutama na bwomi kutama kwa mbone, kulye, nukunywe nukube na laa!’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu Nnoongo ngannengela, ‘Mwe majinga! Lele kilo bwomi gwinu mautoligwa. Na ilebe yoa yenie eimikibekile maiba yabeneke?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngajomole kulenga, “Ngapibile kwa mundu ojwakibekela uloi magambu gakwe mwene, nambu jwenio kileje nnongi ja Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhyobale Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kubokapenia Yesu ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe, “Na yene nannenge makapwelejekwa nhwalo gwa chakulya chimikipala kwa bwomi gwinu na ngobo imipala kwa mmele gwinu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bwomi kilebe cha mbone kupeta chakulya nammele nga gwambone kupeta ngobo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Milibone likongolo, kupandaje mbeju, wala kuunaje na wala ikokwe gakwetije Nnoongo kagalichanga ilyo genia! Mangweto mmi mambone kupeta ijuni! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bene kati jinu kwa kube na mbwele kuotola kujonjekea bwomi gwakwe? Anda kuotojekilebe hata kichokochoko kwa nike kupwelela kwa ilebe yenge? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Anda kuotojekilebe hata kichokochoko kwa nike kupwelela kwa ilebe yenge? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Magabonange maloba ga mpongote apagamalika, kamwaje maengo na kulokaje. Nambu nannenge, mwene Nngwana Solomoni mukibumo chakwe choa akwinditije chwapi andi maloba aga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Anda Nnoongo alikwindia yene manyai ga mung'onda agabi leleno na malabo galekeligwa pa mwoto, bo bantendelangaje muno mangweto? Mangweto mabandu bina imani njoko yankweti!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Yene makapweleje nukuwacha, nniaganga nike andaje nywaganga nike. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwa bandu boa bangammanya Nnoongo machoba goa bagabegelela genia goa. Awawa binu bukumbengu bagamanyi goa gampalanga. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mikibegelelange oti Kingwana cha Nnoongo, na genia gowa mabampaganga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Utajili gu kumbengu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Makajogopangaje, mangweto kikuta kichoko cha akinapunji bango! Gambu Awawa binu bukumbengu bapala kumpe Kingwana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nhwuchange yoa eyankwetingite makapegange akanhocho ela yenie. Mijibeke miuku jinu kube chwapi na kukibekela lupambo kumbengu jenie Kwenio jipungukaje, magambu kwenio akabwii kuotoje kujipata na gabije mabongo agaotwi kualabia. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Penia apalubi lupambo lwinu nga apaupakube mwojo gwinu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Akabanda abaagabala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Mmegange tela kwa goa na muli yinu ibe ikajaka, <verse number="36" style="v"/>mmegange anda akabanda abalendela angwana babe babuje kuboka kumpapala bajogolele nniango kingobucho echikipaligwe pabapakugomba oti. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mbaya akabanda ababakakole angwana babe babilingite mio kalenda! Nannenge kweli, benia mabikipangania kabegelela, nakalenge ntamange pukulye na benia kabegelela. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Anda bakabuja panakati ja kilo andaje puiku na kakolela bakakelukianga mbaya jabe akabanda benia! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mmanyange kube ikabi nkolanyumba akamanyi kingobu mwihi chapakuika, kabi akelukie, na kabi ajilekitije nyumba jakwe jibomaligwe. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ata mangweto mmegange tela, gambu Mwana jwa Mundu maika mangobu gangamanyika.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mmanda ojwaaminika na jwangaaminika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayo 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Petulo ngalenga, “Angwana, kulandanakia kwenio magambu ga bandu boa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Angwana ngabajanga, “Meneke ojwabi mpakachi jwaaminike na jwambone? Jwenio ananhota bakwe mabammeka alolele akabanda bakwe ibe bape chakulya kingobu echikipaligwa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mbaya mpakachi jwojo jubakunkole ananhota mundu akakamula genia! <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kweli mampa kugoya ilebe yakwe yoa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nambu anda mpakachi jwenio akilenge mwene, ‘Ananhota bango batenda kuchelwa kubuja,’ kingobucho nu kutumbu kaputanga abanda ajakwe, akinalome na akikege, nukulye nukunywe nukulobela, <verse number="46" style="v"/>ananhota mundu bibuja lichoba lyangamanyika ni kingobu changamanyika, nu kunhweketa ipande ibena, nu kummeke lipungu lyakwe pamwe na bandu banga amini.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Mmanda ojwamanyi echibapala ananhota bakwe nambu kamwaje andi ipabapala ananhotamundu abakuputigwa muno. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nambu mmanda jwenio ojwatenda gangapala ananhota bakwe nambu amanyije agabapala anahota bakwe maputigwa kachoko. Ojubampi ijingi malongigwa ijingi, ojubampi kachoko malongigwa kachoko.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bajambukia bandu kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Nhikila kupamba mwoto padunia, mbaya gwakabi ujakite! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ngweti ubaticho gwa kupoteka ogumbaligwa nupokele, nubegelela kibegele nike ulenganile! <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nkitanga nhikila kuleta tengela padunia? Na kachokochokoje, tengelaje nambu kulekana. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kutumbu ngoe, lungolo lwa bandu lukibagana, akatatu kati ja akabele, akabele kati ja akatatu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Awawa bankana mwana jwabe munalome, mwana bakana Awamundu, Amama bankana mwana jwabe munkege, mwana munkege bakana amamamundu, akimundu akege bakana ajumbo na ajumbo bakana aniamundu akege.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kumanya mangobu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayo 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu ngaulenge kabe nkengeni gwa bandu, “Apamagabona maunde gakapitila kingonu cha kundonde, nnenganga, ‘Ula majikoma,’ nakweli ukoma. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Apamubona upepo gukubanda gukagugumaga, nnenganga, ‘Mapaba niliuke lele,’ na kweli kube. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mangwetomwe makandendemundu mmanyangite kulondola upepo na maunde ni ilebe yu kumbengu kwa nike kumanyaje mangobu ganga?</para>
  <para style="s">Nchikachane na nngondwa jwinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayo 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>“Mbone kuotolangaje mmene kumanya minhalo ja mbone jukamula? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Maana anda jumunnemwite ampeleka kamaakama yakabi mbaya kwinu kuchikachana nakwe milingiti tango undela, ibe akaikaje kumpeleka nnongi ja akimu na akimu akampange ku nkolongwa jwa manjolinjoli, na angweto kummeka mukipungo. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Nannengela kweli, mpitaje mwenio mpaka apampakujomole kulepa senti ja kujomola ligambo linu.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nnapange mabaja ginu andaje manhweganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mangobu genia bandu bange ngabaika, ngabannenge Yesu nhwalo gwa bandu ba ku Galilaya abakomigwe na Pilato na myai jabe ngajangabana na myai ji inyama yabapanganga lilumbo kwa Nnoongo kwa Nnoongo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Magambu bandu ba ku Galilaya bena bakomigwa kwa magambu genia mpemele kube benia bakiba akabaja kupeta bange aka Galilaya? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, na mangweto uyo pangalapa malemwa ginu mpakuwaganga anda bange pabawaga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Andaje baba komi na nane abagwelile nnala kwako ku Siloamu, ngabaweganga, nkitanga bombe bakibanga akabaja muno kupeta bandu bowa ba Kuyelusalemu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nannenge nyeneje, angweto bakiba na malemwaje nambu mangweto pangalapa majambi ginu, manhwaganga anda bombe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandakia kwa nkongo gwa ngokwa gwangapambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kubokapenia, Yesu ngabalengela kulandanakia kongo, “Mundu jumwe akiba nankongo gwa ngokwa ya zabibu munng'onda gwakwe. Mundu jwenio ngajenda kupala kutongola ngokwa, nambu aikolije. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngannengela nkamumaengo jwakwe, ‘Nnole, kwa yaka itatu inke kupala ngokwa ya nkongo gongo, nambu mbatiteje kilebe. Muwekete! Kwanike ntumia lutuba lwa lutope panga kilebe?’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu jwenio ngannyanga, ‘Ananhota, tuleke kabele chaka cheno, manutindikia ntalu nukujela mbolea. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Anda upambike ngokwa manicha, nga chwapi, andaje bai muweketage.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia munkege jumwe lichoba lya Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu akiba akabolela munyumba ji kugongalela lichoba lya Kupomolela. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pena pakiba na munkege jumwe ojwakiba ntamwe kwa yaka komi na nane, magambu nchepela. Mmele gwakwe gukiba na kindunduma ngachipula kujema gwicho. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu apammona ngankema nukunenge, “Makege, mme agabwa kitamwe chinu kinnekite.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu ngammekela maboko gakwe kingobucho mmele gwakwe ngalama kabele, ngannumba Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu nkolongwa jwa nyumba ja kugongalela ngabachimwa muno magambu Yesu annamia munkege jwenio lichoba lya Kupomolela. Yene ngabalenge bandu babakonganinge penia, “Nkwetingite machoba sita ga kamu maengo, bai nhwikange machoba genia bannamiange itamwe inu, nambu makaikangaje lichoba lya Kupomalela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Penia Angwana ngabajanga, “Mangweto makandendemundu! Mene kati jinu kabi annyogolile ng'ombe jwakwe andaje liponda lyakwe kupita mukitundu ajende kunywe mache, ata ikabi lichoba lyene nga lya Kupomalela? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngoe, pamba abi biti Ulaimu jwombe Lichetani likate kunnemaya kukingobu cha yaka komi na nane. Bo, ikiba kuwalaje kunnyogolela kutabigwa kwakwe lichoba lya Kupomalela?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apalenga genia, akangondwa bakwe ngabalola oni nambu bandu bange boa ngababeganga na laa kwa magambu ga ilebe ikolongwa yoa eyibantendile.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa mbeju njokonjoko ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu ngakonya, “Kingwana cha Nnoongo kilandine nanike? Nenganakia na nike? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nga anda mbeju njokonjoko ikemigwa haladali eyapandite mundu jumwe kunng'onda gwakwe, ngimalika na kube nkongo. Ijuni yu kunani ngichenga miu jakwe mu ndambi yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa kimela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayo 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngakonya kabele, “Nenganakia na nike Kingwana cha Nnoongo? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nga anda amila ejibatoi amama bamwe ngabatindagana na madebe mabele na nusu ga unga, penia unga gwoa ngutupa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nniango nchokochoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayo 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu pajenda Kuyelusalemu ngapete kunnyini na kuijiji, kutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mundu jumwe ngakonya, “Bo, Angwana, bandu abapakomboligwa nga achoko?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabalengelanga, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nkachanange kujingila kwa kupetela nniango ogubi nchokochoko, gambu bandu mabajiganga kujingila nambu baotolangaje. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mangobu magaika penia akola nyumba bamajinuka nu kujigala nniango, mangweto mijemanga panja na kutumbu kutaukana nniango nukulenga, ‘Angwana mutujogolele nniango.’ Nambu bombe binnyanga ‘Nummaanyije mmokanga kole.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Namangweto mitumbula kunnengela, ‘Twe nga baba tatulila nakunywe pamwe na mwenga, na mwenga ngammola muijiji ito.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nambu bombe bilenga ‘Numanyije mangweto mmokanga ko, mmokange pamba, mangweto nkamwa mabaja.’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nga apapapakube na nguto na kuyaga mino, mangobu apampakabonanga Ulaimu na Isaka na Yakobo na akalondoli boa babi mukingwana cha Nnoongo, nambu mmeni mangweto nnekeligwe panja! <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bandu mabaika kuboka kumbwani na kundonde, kuboka kuchanya na kubanda na kutama pa mpapala Mukingwana cha Nnoongo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Elo, ababi bukujomolela bibaganga bu kutumbula, na ababi bukutumbula biba bukujomolela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kukupala Kuyelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayo 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mangobu ugogo, Mafalisayo na bandu bange ngabannyendelela Yesu ngabannengela, “Mmoke pamba nnyabule paali pange, kwa magambu Helode apala kunkoma.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Nnyendange makalengele alibwea nyene, ‘Leleno na malabo mengamichepela na kalamia akatamwe, na lichoba lya tatu nijomolela liengo lyango.’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ata nyenie, kwa leleno, malabo na papacha, mpaka nyendeke na mwanja gwango, kwa magambu telaje nnondoli akomigwe panja ja Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mwe ma Yelusalemu, Mwe ma Yelusalemu! Makomanga akalondoli na kaputa maganga akapakachi ba Nnoongo abakingite kwinu! Palenga nyigite kuikongola ingota yinu kwango andi ngoko apaikongola yana yakwe nkati ja mapapanilo gakwe, nambu mapaije. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Aja! Nyumba jinu jiba ukeba. Nannengelanga, umonaje kabe mpaka apampa kulenga, ‘Alumbigwe ojwaika kuliina lya Angwana.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu ntamwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe lya Kupomalela Yesu ngajenda kulye chakulya kachakwe kilongoi jumwe jwa Mafalisayo, na bandu ngabannolekeya Yesu kukunhwingikia. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nnongi jakwe Yesu pakiba na mundu jumwe ojwakiba na kitamwe cha kutupa mmele. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonyanga akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, “Bo kweli andaje ipaligweje kunnamia mundu Lichoba lya Kupomalela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngaba tamanga nu. Yesu ngankamu ntamwe jwenio, ngannamia na nganneka ajabule. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kingobutu ngabalenge, “Beneke kati jinu bombe mwana jwabe andaje ng'ombe jwabe akajingi mulibomba kabi bampiitije ata ikabi Lichoba li Kupomalela?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Angweto baotolingije kunnyanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukina nu lutengo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ngaba bona angweto abakokigwe apabakiba bikikipambula paali pa ichima, ngabalengelanga kulandanakia kongo, <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Anda mundu ankokite kumpapala gwa kutola akege, makatamaje paali pa ichima, iotwile akokigwe nngwana jonge jwambone kumpeta mwenga, <verse number="9" style="v"/>na akola nyumba, abankokite mangweto mabele, mabaika nukunnengela, ‘Malekele benia kitebu chenie.’ Penia mpakola oni nnongi ja boa na ipaligwa kujenda kutama kunyuma. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nambu anda bankokite kumpapala gwa kutola akege, ntama paali pa mwicho ibe nkolanyumba apapakuika annengele, ‘Aganja, nhwike nnongi pano, paali pambone muno.’ Penia mamiba nikibumo nnongi ja boa abatamangite pamwe na mwenga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwa magambu jwajotijola ojwa kitondobe aba kuuluigwa na ojwa kiuluya aba kutondobigwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngannengela na benia abakokite, “Anda mapanganikiinge mpapala nalumu andaje kimuyo, makakokangaje akaganja binu andaje akanuna binu andaje akalonga binu akandamya ajinu ababi binu uloi bakaikangaje na benia mabankokanga, namwenga mamma bannepite chache echi matendelinge. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ipaligwa apameka mpapala, makokange akaocho, abalemile, nangwaba na bangalola, <verse number="14" style="v"/>na mwenga mamma mpatite upeele, kwa magambu benia bakwetangitije chu kunnepa. Gambu Nnoongo mampa malepo ginu mangobu bandu bina mojo gwambone apabapakuyoka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa mpapala nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayo 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Jumwe jwa abatamangite pamwe na Yesu apajowa genia ngalenga, “Mbaya mundu ojwa pakutama nu kulye chakulya muki Ngwana cha Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Mundu jumwe akabeka mpapala nkolongwa ngabakokanga bandu ajingi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kingobu cha mpapala pikiika ngantuma mmanda jwakwe bakalenge bandu baike ilebe yowa ilenganile! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambu ngabatumbulanga jumwejumwe kujopa balekekeyange. Ju kutumbula ngannenge mmanda, ‘Emile nng'onda na yene mbaligwa kujenda kulola, nanji nannyopa unneke nakaikaje kumpapala gwinu.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Jonge ngalenga, ‘Emile ng'ombe komi ya kulema na mbaligwa kujenda kuijiga nannyopa unneke.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Jonge ngalenga, ‘Nanji ndoi akege na yene otoje kuika.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mmanda jola ngabuja kangwana mundu ngalenga goa. Angwana mundu ngabachimwa muno nu kunnenge mmanda jwakwe, ‘Nnyende chokwe kundela na kila kimbatikwa chi kilambo makakeme baikange pamba akahocho na bangalola na nangwaba na abalemalinge boa.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuboka penia mmanda jola ngalenga, ‘Angwana ilebe yoa ngamwile anda apaunengile, nambu kiigi chumbi chimwe.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Angwana bala ngabannenge mmanda, ‘Nnyende kundela na kila kimbatikwa makaamuliche bandu baikange mpaka nyumba jango jitwelele. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli mmoa kutenda boa banakokangite ojwapakupaya chakulya cha mpapala gwango!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Ojwapaligwa kube ndundame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayo 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Penia nkengeni nkolongwa gwa bandu pabannyendelela Yesu, ngabatendebukia ngabalenge, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mundu jwajwoa ojwaika kwango nenga anda nukumbalaje ne kupeta awamundu na amamundu na aanamundu ni ingota yabe na akalombo mundu na akakolo mundu na mwene, kuotoje kube napunji jwango. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Jwajwoa jwangapotola nchalaba gwakwe nu kungengama kuotoje kube napunji jwango.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Magambu beneke panakati jinu ojwapala kuchenga ulingo nukutama otije kubalanga aimanye ilebe ipaligwa anda maijomolelage? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Andaje kuboka pukuchimika tu eke nukuchipula kujomola na bandu kunhweka, <verse number="30" style="v"/>kulenga, ‘Mundu ojo ngatumbu kuchenga nambu ajomwileje.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Andaje Nngwana jwako ojwapala kujenda ukomana na Ngwana nnyakwe, nukutama otije nu kuwacha maotolage, kwa matyala gakwe elufu komi nu kujomana na jwajo juna matyala alufu ichilini? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Andaloi maotoje mabatuma apakachi kujopa malobe ga tengela nakongo abi kutaali na Ngwana jwenio. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Uyo abije na jumweje kati jinu ojwapa kube napunji jwango anda nikiilekaje ilebe yakwe yowa.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulaa kwa mwinyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mwinyo chwapi, nambu anda andauoite kulaa kwakwe, kuotoje kubukia kulaa kwakwe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kulaaje nakwa lutopije nakwa lutubaje, bandu kulekela tu. Juna machikilo ajoe!”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na limbelele eliobite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe akatocha kodi na bina mabaja ajingi ngabajenda kumpenekeya Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabatumbu kuchonjoya, “Munnolakeye mundu ojo! Babandakila bina mabaja, na kabe atenda kulye nabo.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga kwa kulandanakia,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Nhwacha panakati jinu jumwe anda akweti mambelele makomi komi, anda nnoi kube limwe liobite ntenda bole? Mpakagaleka gaga makomi tisa na tisa papongote nu kujenda kulipalapala lyale eliobite mpaka mulibone. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Anda mulibweni mpakuala mwojo nu kulipoto pilipamba <verse number="6" style="v"/>nu kubuja nalyo kachakwe. Na kakema akandami ajinu na akamaganja binu pamwe na kalenge benia, ‘Mbi na laa muno nilibweni limbelele lyango iliobite. Aja tuinange!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Uyo, nannenge, papakube na laa kumbengu kwa magambu ga mundu jumwe kulapa mabaja gakwe, kupeta bandu makomi tisa na tisa ababikibona bambone, bangapala kugaleka malemwa gabe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na uloi oguobite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Andaje nnolabo? Tulenge akiba munkege jumwe anda akweti uloi komi anda aoite jimwe atenda bole? Apamba lumuli, nu kupyagila nyumba joa na kupala kwa kuingakia muno mpaka kuibona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Anda ajipatite, mabakemanga akaganja mundu na akandami mundu nu kulenga, ‘Nhwalalilange pamwe na nenga, magambu nupatite uloi gwango oguobite.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Uyo nannengelanga, nga apabapakualalilanga akapakachi ba Nnoongo kwa magambu ga juna malemwa jumwe ojwalapa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na mwana ojwa obite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Pakiba na mundu jumwe ojwakiba na ingota ibele ikanalome. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nchokujola ngabalengela awamundu, ‘Awawa, umbe ulichi gwango.’ Bombe ngababaganakia mali gabe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuboka pa machoba machoko, nchokujola ngaucha ulichi gwakwe, ngaboka mwanja na uloi gwakwe ogwa patite, ngajabwa kilambo cha kutaali kwenio ngajomola uloi gwoa kwa ilebe ya kipuchi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Apajomola uloi gwoa, ngukupiti njala ngolongwa mukilambo chenie, jwombe ngatumbu kulolalola. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngajopa liengo kwa akola kilambo bakwenio bombe ngabampeleka kunng'onda gwakwe kugape chakulya magolobe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Alokalela kulye mangai agagalya magolobe, nambu akibaje mundu ojwampile kilebe chukulye. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apatumbula kolamalango, ngawacha, ‘Mboni babi akakamwamaengo ndu ba awabango abalye na kuigaya, na nenga nhwe njala? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mamuja kawabango na kalengela, Awawa, nijilemwite mbengu, na mwenga uyo nannemwite. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mbaligwije ata ukemigwa mwana gwinu. Undendi andi jumwe jwa akakamwa maengo binu.’ ” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngatumbu mwanja gwa kubuja ka awamundu.</para>
  <para style="p">“Apakiba tango abi kutaali, awamundu ngaba mmona, na kwamwojo gwa kia ngabammutakila, ngankumbatila. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwana ngabalengela, ‘Awawa, nijilemwite mbengu na mwe uyo nannemwite. Mbaligwije ata ukemigwa namwana binu.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nambu awamundu ngabalengela akapakachi bakwe, ‘Nnyombaketange! Nnetange ngobo inachwapi makankwindiyange! Makankwindiyange pete ni ilatu! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Manchinjilange likoga eliatite, tulye nu kualalila! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwa magambu ga manango jono akiba awile, nambu ngoe abi mmomi, akate kuoba, nambu ngoe abonikine.’ ” Ngaba tumbu kutenda mpapala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Mangobu genia akakamundu bakiba tango kunng'onda. Apakiba akabandakila kachakwe, ngajoa ilulu na ng'oma. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ngankema mpakachi jumwe, ngankonya, ‘Kibi nike?’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mmanda jwenio ngannengela, ‘Nnuna gwinu abujite ukaja, na awabinu banchinji likoga eliatite kwa magambu bampatite abi telatela.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Kakombo jwenio nkolo ngabe nililaka na ngakana kujingila unyumba. Awamundu ngabapita panja nukumpembela ajingile unyumba. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nambu jwombe ngabajanga, ‘Nkombakele! Yaka yoa nammegalile, nanakanaje amuli jinu. Umbi nike? Umbije ata mwana mbui jumwe nakatendi mpapala na akaganja bango! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu mwana gwinu ojwajitine uloi gwinu kwa upuchi pamwe na akangongola, kingobu tu apaika manchinjile likoga eliatite!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Awamundu ngabannyanga, ‘Manango, mwe mmi pamwe na nenga machoba goa, na kila echimbinacho nga chinu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ngutupaligwa kutengenecha mpapala na kualalila, kwa magambu ununa gwinu jono, akiba awile, nambu abi momi, akiba aobite, nambu ngoe abonikine.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa mpakachi mmaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Junauloi jumwe na mpakachi jwakwe. Mpakachi jwenio akatekopakigwa kube alile uloi gwa mundu jumwe, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mundu juna uloi jola ngankema, ngannengela, ‘Nga nhwalo nike ogunujoa kwinu mwenga? Mmalange eya mpatite na eibokite ya uloi gwango, kwa mana nhwotwije kube mapakachi kabele.’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mpakachi jola ngawacha, ‘Angwana bamengite liengo lya ukongola, ngamula nike? Kujenda kulema nhotwije, kujenda kujopajopa andi akahocho nga oni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Elo, manyi lyu kamula! Ibe apabapakumenga liengo, bandu bambokelange kachabe.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ngabakemanga abalongigwa na anahota mundu, jumwe. Ngannenge ju kutumbula, ‘Nnongigwa uloi nnenga na angwana bango?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jwenio ngajanga, ‘Mapipa makomi komi ga mauta ga uto.’ Kalani jola ngalenga ntole likalatachi eliandikwe ligambo linu, ‘nhwandika makomi nhwano.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngankonya jonge, ‘Mwenga nnongigwa uloi nnenga?’ Jwombe ngajanga, ‘Magunia makomi komi ngano.’ Kalani ngalenga, ‘Ntole likalatachi linu eliandikwe ligambo linu nhwandika makomi komi pa nane.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Angwana mundu ngabannumbalila kalani jwenio jwanga aminika, kwa magambu ga kalamuka kwakwe, magambu bandu ba padunia jenje akakalamui kupeta bandu abanhwamini Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Na yenie nannenge mmekange maganja na bandu kukutumia ilebe ya padunia, ibe pampakujomola bampokele kubwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mundu jwajwoa ojwaba kuaminika kwa kilebe kichokochoko na kikolongwa uyo na jwangaaminika kwa kilebe kichokochoko na kikolongwa uyo kuaminikaje. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Anda mmi kuaminikaje kugoya uloi mmaja gwa padunia, beneke abapakunkamuya kugoya uloi gwa kweli oguboka kwa Nnoongo? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Anda mangweto kuaminikaje kugoya ilebe ya mundu jonge, beneke abapakunkamuya ilebe inu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Abije mmanda jwaotwile kabegelela akangwana abena, magambu apakunchimwa jumwe nu kumpala jonge andaje apakulongwana na jumwe na kummembula jonge. Kuotoje kummegelela Nnoongo nu ilebe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kilonge chenge cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kingobu Mafalisayo pabajoa genia goa, ngabammembula Yesu magambu angweto bakate kupala muno uloi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela benia, “Mangweto mikibekanga kube mabandu bambone nnongi ja bandu, nambu Nnoongo ajimanyi myojo jinu. Magambu ilebe ibonekana yambone nnongi ja bandu yamboneje nnongi ja Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Malagilo ga Musa na majandiko ga akalondoli ba Nnoongo gakiba gakatangachigwa mpaka kingobu cha Yohana Mmatichi, kutumbu penia Nhwalo Gwambone gu Kingwana cha Nnoongo kutangachigwa na kila mundu ajingi kwa makakala. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nambu kindema kwa mbengu na dunia kujomoka kupeta lunembo lumwe lwa Malagilo ga Musa kuboya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mundu jwa jwoa ojwanneka nhwanamundu nu kutola jonge munkege atenda ngongola, na munalome ojwantola munkege ojwalekine na angwana mundu, atenda ngongola.</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu juna uloi na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Pakiba na Mundu juna uloi na akwinda ngobo ina bei ngolongwa muno na kubeka mipapala machoba goa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Na penia pakiba na nhwocho jumwe liina lyakwe Lazalo, jwenio akiba na ilonda mmele gwoa na bakibanga kummeka ku mundu juna uloi panniango. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ahyobalela kulye imbolopolo itola kuboka pa mecha ja juna uloi. Na imbwa ngiika kunnamba ilonda yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Nhwochojo ngajomoka na akapakachi kuboka kumbengu ngabantola kummeka papipi na Ulaimu kumbengu. Na mundu juna uloi ngajomoka ngabanchika. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mundu juna uloi pakiba akapotekigwa kumambi, ngajinula mio gakwe ngammona Ulaimu kutaali na Lazalo papipi nakwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ngakema kunonoya, ‘Awawa ana Ulaimu, umone kia, muntume Lazalo ata ikabi kuchwika tu lukonji lwakwe umache, alupe laa lulimi lwango, magambu ndenda kupotekigwa muno na mwoto gongo!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nambu Ulaimu ngalenga, ‘Nkombakela, gwe manango, ngantama na laa ilebe ina chwapi yoa ngampata, na Lazalo ngapata mabaja. Nambu ngoe Lazalo abi mukupomolela na mwenga ntenda kupotekigwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nayene panakati ja twe na mangweto pabi na libomba likolongwa, ibe mundu ojwa pala kuika kongo akaotoje na mundu ojwaboka kongo kuika kwenio akaotoje.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mundu ojwakiba nu uloi ngajanga, ‘Bai awawa lele nannyopa muntume Lazalo ajende kachabe awabango, <verse number="28" style="v"/>magambu ngweti inunu yango nhwano bakelebuye kamwa mabaja ibe bakaikaje kongo kupotakigwa.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Ulaimu ngajanga, ‘Inunu inu bakweti majandiko ga Musa na akalondoli, bakakelebuya baleke mabajowanga.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mundu juna uloi ngajanga, ‘Awawa ana Ulaimu yeneje nambu anda mundu ayokite kuboka kwa abawile kajendelela mabalapa.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Jwombe Ulaimu ngalenga, ‘Anda kajowangaje majandiko ga Musa na akalondoli ba Nnoongo, bajobokangaje ata mundu akayokite kuboka kwa abawile.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Malemwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayo 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maluko 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe, “Iwechikinije pakapitije ipengu eijambukia malemwa, nambu kulaga kwa mundu jwenio ojwapakijambuki ipitile! <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ikabi mbaya kwa mundu jwenio kutabigwa pantandala libwe likolongwa lya kuyagila na kulekaligwa kubaali, kuliko kunnyambukia jumwe jwa akachoko aba kutenda malemwa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ntamanga maha!</para>
  <para style="p">“Andi nnunagwinu annemwite, mankelebuye, anda alapite, mannekekeye. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Na anda annemwite mala saba kwa lichoba, na kila mangobu akabuja kwinu akalenga, ‘Napite,’ ipaligwa munnekekeye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Achandundame ngabalenge Angwana, “Mutujonjekeye imani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Angwana ngabajanga, “Na ati makabi na imani njokochoko andi mbonje njokonjoko andi ya aladali, kabi nhwotolinge kulenge nkongo gongo gwa nkuju, ‘Nnyikuke makakipandakile kubaali,’ kabi gunnyalite.</para>
  <para style="s">Liengo lya mpakachi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Tulenge jumwe kati jinu akweti mpakachi jwombe alema kunng'onda andaje achunga mambelele. Bo, apabuja kuboka kunng'onda, binnengela mpakachi jwenio, nnyombakete, nhwiche nnie chakulya? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ije! Binnengela, ‘Umbanganikie chakulya, mme tela kundumikia mpaka pa mbakujomola kulye na kunywe, kubokapenia namwe nnia na kunywe.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bo, minnumba mpakachi jwenio kwa magambu alenganakie agabannengile? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na mangweto uyo anda nteile goa agabannengile, nnengange, ‘Twe nga akapakachi tanga nyonjekea, tulenganakie tu gaga agatulengile ukamwa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamia bina maloi komi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba mumwanja kujenda Kuyelusalemu ngapetela umbwega ja ku Samalia na ku Galilaya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apakiba akajingila mu kijiji chimwe, bandu komi bina maloi ngabakongana nakwe, ngabajemanga kwa kutaali. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngaba tondobeanga lilobe ngabalenga, “Yesu Ananhota, mutubone kia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu apababonanga ngabalengela, “Nnyendange mikikilayange kwa akakung'i.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngibe apabakiba bakajendanga, ngabajeguka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Jumwe kati jabe apalola kube alamiigwe, ngabuja akannumba Nnoongo kwa lilobe likolongwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngakilikitila pae nnongi ja makongono ga Yesu kongo akannumba. Jwenio akiba Nsamalia. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Bo, bandu komije abajeguigwe? Baba tisa babilingite ko? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Apatikinije jonge ojwabujite kumpe kibumo Nnoongo nambu mundu jonjo tu jwanga Uhyahudi?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngannengela mundu jwenio, “Nnyeme, nnyabule, imani jinu jinnamie.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuika kwa kingwana cha Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayo 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mangobu gamwe, Mafalisayo ngabankonya Yesu, “Kingwana cha Nnoongo kiika lii?”</para>
  <para style="p">Jwombe ngabajanga, “Kingwana cha Nnoongo kiika pangabonekana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na abije ojwa pakuotola kulenga, ‘Kibi pamba,’ andaje ‘Kibi papa.’ Kwa magambu Kingwana cha Nnoongo kibi nkati jinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Penia ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Machoba gaika penia mipalanga kulola lichoba limwe lya Mwana jwa Mundu, nambu milibonangaje. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Na bandu binnengela, ‘Nnolange, abi papa!’ Andaje ‘Nnolange, abi pamba!’ Nambu mangweto makabokangaje na makakengamangaje. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Gambu andi njai pijipiti kingobu tu nu kung'ala kunani kingonu chimwe mpaka chenge, ngapipakube lichoba likuika kwakwe Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nambu panga pitila oti genia, apaligwa apotekigwe muno na ukanigwa na kibelei chenje. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Anda apikiba kingobu cha Nuhu, nga apipakube mumachoba ga Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bandu ngabajendekea kulye na kunywe, kutola akege na kutoligwa na analome mpaka kingobu chenie Nuhu apajingila mu ntumbwi nkolongwa. Ngondo ngijipitila na kapotekanga boa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ipakube anda apipitila mangobu ga Lutu. Bandu ngabajendekea kulya na kunywe, kuemela na kuucha, kupanda mbeju na kuchenga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nambu lichoba lyenie Lutu apajabula Kusodoma, mwoto na mabwe ga mwoto ngagauluka kuboka kumbengu na kakomanga boa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nga apipakube lichoba lyenie Mwana jwa Mundu apapakuekuligwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Lichoba lyenie, jwajoa ojwabi panani ja kinyanga akaulukaje kujenda ukaja kutola ilebe yakwe. Uyo, ojwapakube kunng'onda akabujaje unyuma. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nkombokelange agagampatite nhwana gwa Lutu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mundu jwajoa ojwapala kukombola bwomi gwakwe, apakuoya, na mundu jwajoa ojwauoya bwomi gakwe, apakukombola. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nannengelanga, lichoba lyenie kilo bandu abele bigolokanga pamwe, jumwe aitoligwa na jonge ailekigwa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Akikege abena bibaganga bakayaganga okole pamwe, jumwe aitoligwa na jonge ailekigwa.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bandu akabele bibaganga kunng'onda, jumwe aitoligwa na jonge ailekigwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Penia ngabankonya, “Nga kole Angwana?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabajanga, “Apubi ntui, ngapagakongana matumbui.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na Nawele na hakimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngabalenge kulandanakia kwa hakimu kupala kabolanga akinapunji kube bagongalelange Nnoongo kila kingobu na bakachipulaje na kachokoje. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngabalenge, “Pikilambo chimwe pakiba na hakimu jwenio akiba kunyalije Nnoongo na kaechimuje bandu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na pikilambo chenie pakiba na munkege jumwe nawele ojubajendelela machoba goa kajopa kupala ilebe yakwe kuboka kwakangondwa bakwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwa machoba majingi hakimu jwenio apaije kunnyeketela apate, nambu kukujomolela ngalenga kumojo jakwe, ‘Nenga ng'anu kube kunnyogopaje Nnoongo na kaechimuje bandu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>magambu nawele ojo atenda kunjumbuya, mbakumpe chapala. Andaje apakunjumbuya muno kukuinkalila kila kingobu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Angwana ngabajendekeya kulenga, “Mpenikiye palongila hakimu mmaja. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nnoongo bajangataje bandu bakwe abapambwile, abanng'utila kilo na mui? Bo, apakuchelwa kapenakia? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nannenge, apakajangata, kabe chokwe. Bo maikolela imani padunia kingobu Mwana jwa Mundu apapakuika?”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa Mafalisayo na akatocha kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Uyo Yesu ngabalenge bandu kulandanakia kwa bandu bange abakitenda bandu ba mbone na kabembula bange. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Penia pakiba na bandu abele ngabajendanga kulubanja lwa nyumba ja kugongalela, jumwe akiba Falisayo na jonge akiba ntocha kodi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Falisayo ngajema ngagongalela kumojo na kulenga, ‘Ana Nnoongo, ndenda nnumba, magambu nenga mbi andi bandu bangeje, akapoki na akawangi andaje akangongola. Nannumba kube ne andi ntocha kodi ojoje. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mbunga machoba mabena kwa wiki, mbanga lipungu lya komi kuilebe yoa yambata.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Ntocha kodi ngajema kutaali na wala ajinwikeje kulola kumbengu nambu ngakilikitila kukuechuka nu kulenga, ‘Ana Nnoongo, umone kia nenga nambi na mabaja!’ ” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Nannenge kweli ntocha kodi abuja kachakwe kongo abonekana jwambone nnongi ja Nnoongo. Nambu Mfalisayo joje. Magambu kila ojwa kitondobe aba kuuluigwa na kila ojwa kiuluya aba kutondobaigwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ailumika ingota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bandu bange ngabampelekela Yesu ingota ilumikigwe. Akinapunji apabalola genia ngabakanakia, <verse number="16" style="v"/>nambu Yesu ngaikema ingota nu kulenga, “Mileke ingota iike kwango mikikanakiaje, magambu Kingwana cha Nnoongo kibekigwe kwa bandu anda benia. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nkombakela yene! Mundu jwajwoa nukukipokelaje Kingwana cha Nnoongo anda mwana, ajingije mu Kingwana chenie.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu juna uloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kilongoi jumwe ngankonya Yesu, “Aboli mambone ndendabole, mbate bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ngankonya, “Kwanike kungema ne nambone? Abije jwambone nambu Nnoongo jika jakwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Magamanyi Malagilo ga Musa, ‘Makabe na ngongolaje, makakomaje na makajibaje na makapanga uchaili gu uwangije kajali awawa binu na amama binu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Jwenio ngalenga, “Genia goa nagaagabile tango apanakiba nakakombo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kingobu Yesu apajoa genia, ngannenge mundu jwenio, “Kiigi kilebe chimwe chikipaligwa kamula. Makauche ilebe yoa einkweti uloi gwene mapegange akahocho na mama manuloi kumbengu, penia nhwike ungengame.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu mundu jwenio pajoa genia, ngachimwa muno magambu akiba nuloi muno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu apalola akachimwa yenie, ngalenga, “Ibibole apibi kujundupa kwa bina uloi kujingila mukingwana cha Nnoongo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Elo, nga kindema muno ngamia kupeta pililanga lya chingana, kumpeta juna uloi kujingi mukingwana cha Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bandu ba apabajoanga genia, ngabalenga, “Nga meneke ojwapakuoto ukomboka?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Gangawechekana kwa mundu, ku Nnoongo kuwechakana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petulo ngankonya, “Na twe bole? Tuilekite ilebe ito yoa tunkengime!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Kweli nannenge, mundu jwajoa ojwalekite nyumba andaje munkege andaje akakamundu andaje achikibelei bakwe andaje ingota kwa magambu ga Kingwana cha Nnoongo, <verse number="30" style="v"/>apakupokela ndu muno ngoe, na bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela mangobu agapakuika.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela mala ja patatu nhwalo gwa kiu na kuyoka kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ngabatolanga komi na abele umbwega, ngabalenge, “Mpenakiange! Tujenda Kuyelusalemu na kwenio kila kilebe echikiandikigwe na akalondoli ba Nnoongo nhwalo gwa Mwana jwa Mundu makilenganila. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bapankamuya kwa bandu banga Akayahudi angweto mabantendela gangambone na kunhuni mata. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mabamputanga iboko na kunkoma, nambu lichoba lya tatu mayoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nambu angweto bamanyangitije nhwalo gwenio ata kichoko, bakate kuiigwa mana ga malobe genia, na bamanyangitije agagalongaligwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia jwangalola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mangobu Yesu apabandakila ku Yeliko, pakiba na mundu jumwe jwangalola atamite papipi akajopa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Apajoa nkengeni gwa bandu gwakapeta ngakonya, “Kubi nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ngannengela, “Yesu juku Nazaleti atendakupeta.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Jwombe ngatondobea lilobe ngalenga, “Yesu, Mwana jwa Daudi, umone kia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Bandu abakiba nnongi ngabankalapila ngabannenge akotoke, nambu jwombe ngayangala kuchobela, “Mwana jwa Daudi, umone kia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu ngajema, ngaamulicha bannete nnongi jakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">Jwangalola jola apaika papipi, Yesu ngankonya, <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Mpala nantende nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">Jwombe ngajanga, “Angwana, nyopa nhoto kulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Nname! Imani jinu jinnamie.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Na kingobu tu jwanga lola jola ngalola, ngankengama Yesu akammegelela Nnoongo. Bandu boa apabalolanga genia, ngabannumba Nnoongo.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngajingila kunnyini ku Yeliko na ngatyanga undela ya munnyini mwenio. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pakiba na mundu jumwe kwenio liina lyakwe Zakayo ojwakiba nkolongwa jwa akatocha kodi na mundu tajili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ngapala kummona Yesu nga meneke, nambu magambu ga bandu ajingi na akiba nnyipi, aotwileje. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Penia, ngalongalela mbelo, ngaombela unani mwa nkoju ibe aotole kummona Yesu, ojwapeta ndela jenie. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu apaika paali penia, ngalola kunani na ngannenge Zakayo, “Nhuluke chokwe Zakayo, magambu mpaka ndame kachinu lele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Zakayo ngauluka chokwe, ngammpokela Yesu kwa kualalila. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bandu boa apabalola genia ngabatumbu kokaleka, bakalenga, “Ajabwile kutama na mundu juna malemwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Zakayo ngajema ngannengela Yesu, “Mpenakie, Ananhota! Nenga manapa akaocho nusu ja mali jango, na anda nampokite mundu jwajoa kilebe, manammujichia mala pa ncheche.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Lele nyumba jenje jikomboligwe magambu angweto uyo kibelei cha Ulaimu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwana jwa Mundu aikile kupalapala na kakombola abaobite.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa akapakachi komi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kingobu bandu apabakiba tango bakapenakia genia, Yesu ngabalengela kulandanakia. Penia akiba abandakila Kuyelusalemu, na bandu benia bakita kingobu tu kingwana cha Nnoongo makiika. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yenie ngabalengela, “Kukiba na mundu jumwe jwa kibelei cha kingwana ojwakiba na mwanja gwa kujenda kilambo cha kutaali ibe apokele liengo lya kingwana, kuboka penia abuje. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tango nu kubokaje, ngabakema akapakachi bakwe komi, ngabape uloi kila mundu tela na kalengela, ‘Mmanyanga mmene chukutendela uloi gwenio mpaka pambakubuja.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu bandu ba kilambo chakwe ngabanchimwa na yenie ngabakinga bandu bajende bakalenge mundu ojwapakummeka abe nngwana, ‘Tampaije jonjo kube nngwana jwito.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mundu jwenio ngabe nngwana na ngabuja. Na kingobu tu ngabalengela akapakachi benia abapi uloi gola bakemigwe kupala amanye kila mundu apatite nyonjakea gani. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mpakachi jwa kutumbula ngaika ngalenga, ‘Angwana, mbatite yenge nyonjakea mala pa komi ku uloi ogumbile.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Jwombe ngannengela, ‘Chwapi, mwenga mapakachi mambone. Magambu mmi nakuaminika kukilebe kichokochoko, manammeka kube ni kinala kuilambo komi!’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mpakachi jwa pili ngaika ngalenga, ‘Angwana mbatite yenge nyonjakea mala pa nhwano ku uloi ogumbile.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Jwombe ngannengela, ‘Namwe mma na amuli kuilambo nhwano.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Mpakachi jonge ngaika, ngalenga, ‘Angwana, uloi gwinu gongo, ngahia gwicho mukitambala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nganyogopa, magambu mamundu makale. Magambu mwe mamundu mantola gangabe ginu, nukutongola changa panda.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Jwombe ngannengela, ‘Mwe mapakachi mabaja! Mbanhwukumula kwa malobe ginu! Mamanyi kube nenga namundu nakale, nandola gangabe gango nukutongola panga panda. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwa nike, mabekiteje uloi gwango kubenki, nane kabi ndoile pamwe na nyonjakea kingobu apamujite kwango?’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Penia, ngabalengela abakiba bajemangite penia, ‘Mammpoke uloi gwenio na makampe mpakachi jwajo jwakweti nyonjakea mala komi.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngabannengela, ‘Angwana, jwombe tayali akweti nyonjekea mala pakomi ja uloi ogwakiba nago!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Jwombe ngabajanga, ‘Kila ojwakweti kilebe mapata nu kunnyonjakea. Nambu jwajo jwanga kola kilebe, ati chache echakweti makitoligwa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na ngoe, akangondwa bango abakanangita ne kube nangwana babe, maletange pambano, makomange upamba nnongi jango!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajingi Kuyelusalemu kwa ilulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kuboka pa kulongela genia, ngalongalela kujenda Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Apabandakila kuika ku Betifage na ku Betania papipi na kitombi cha Mizeituni, ngabatuma akinapunji bakwe abena, <verse number="30" style="v"/>ngabalengela, “Nnyendange kukijiji echikibi nnongi jinu. Apampa kuika kukijiji, mamankolela mwana liponda atabaligwe jwanga ombeligwa na mundu. Mankulugulange na mannetange pamba.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="19:30">Mwana liponda</figure> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Anda mundu ankonyangite mboni milikulugula, mannengela bilipala Angwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ngabajabulanga, ngabakolelanga tela andi Yesu apabalengalinge. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Apabakiba bakankulugula mwana liponda, benekangweto ngabakonya, “Mboni mankulugulanga mwana liponda jonjo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Angweto ngabajanga, “Angwana batenda mpala.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ngabampelekela Yesu mwana liponda jola. Penia ngabatandika ngobo yabe panani jakwe, ngabammeka Yesu panani ja liponda. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba akajendekea na mwanja bandu ngabatandika ngobo yabe omwakiba akapeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Apaika papipi na Kuyelusalemu, puwelelo gwa kitombi cha Mizeituni, nkengeni nkolongwa gwa akinapunji bakwe ngabatumbu kualalila na kunnumba Nnoongo kulilobe likolongwa kwa ikobo ikolongwa yoa eibibweni, <verse number="38" style="v"/>ngababe bakalenga, “Abe ni kindimba Nngwana ojwaika ku liina lya Angwana. Tengela kumbengu ni kibumo ku Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Penia acha Mafalisayo bange abakiba munkenga gwenio ngabannenge Yesu. “Aboli, makotoyange akinapunji binu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Nannengelanga, anda angwetwa bakotokinge, mamabwe magatondabeya lilobe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aigutila Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu apabandakila muno kukibona kilambo cha Kuyelusalemu, ngabagutila bandu ba Kuyelusalemu, <verse number="42" style="v"/>akalenga, “Anda makamanyi lele ilebe eileta tengela! Nambu ngoe mibonaje! <verse number="43" style="v"/>Magambu kingobu makiika akangondwa binu apabapa kuntindikila ndunda ya ngondo nu kuntindilanga nu kunhwibila kila ndela. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Bapa kuntimbatimba mwenga pamwe na bandu binu mumapamanda ginu, bannekeje ati libwe limwe panani ja lenge, magambu mikimanyije kingobu Nnoongo apaika kunkombola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngaika pulubanja lwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo, ngatumbula katipa abauchanga ilebe, <verse number="46" style="v"/>akalenga, “Iandikigwe Mumajandiko, Nnoongo alenga, ‘Nyumba jango majiba nyumba ja kugongalela.’ Nambu mangweto mijigalambwiye kube nduka ja akabuhi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kila machoba Yesu ngabola pulubanja lwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo. Akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na akiilongoi ba bandu ngabapala kunkoma, <verse number="48" style="v"/>nambu bapatangiteje ndela ja kunkoma, magambu bandu boa bakiba bakampenakia, bapalangiteje kupelelwa lilobe.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukonyana unhwalo gwa amuli ja Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe kingobu Yesu apakiba ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo akabola bandu nu kutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone, akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa, pamwe na akinanhota ngabaika, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ngabannengela, “Mutulengele, nkamu ilebe yenje ku kinala gani? Bene abampi kinala chenie?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Na nenga mbakunkonya. Unengele, <verse number="4" style="v"/>uwecho gwa Yohana gukubaticha uboka kumbengu andaje kubandu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ngabatumbu kutaukana, “Tulengabo? Anda tulengite ‘Kuboka ku mbengu,’ alenga, ‘Mboni, munhwaminingije Yohana?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu anda tulengite ‘Kuboka kwa bandu,’ nkengeni ogo gwoa gutuputa mabwe, magambu boa baamininge kutenda Yohana akiba nnondoli jwa Nnoongo.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuyenie ngabannyanga, “Tumanyije uwecho gwenio ubokita ko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na Yesu ngabalengela, “Nane uyo nannengeje ngamwa ilebe yenje kukinala gani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa akalemi munng'onda gwa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kalengela bandu kulandanakia kongo, “Mundu jumwe ngalema nng'onda gwa mizabibu, ngabajaika akalemi, na penia ngaboka mwanja gwa kutaali ngatama kwenio kwa mangobu ndu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kingobu cha mauno, mundu jwenio ngankinga mpakachi jwakwe kwa akalemi bala, akatole paali pa ngoko ga nng'onda gwa mizabibu. Nambu akalemi bala ngabamputa mpakachi jwenio, ngabammuya panga kilebe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ngankinga mmanda jonge, nambu akalemi ngabamputa na jwenio uyo, nu kuntukana na ngabammuya panga kilebe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngankinga mmanda jwa tatu, na jwenio uyo kuboka pu kumpoteka, ngabantipa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nkola nng'onda ngawacha, ‘Ndenda nike? Manankinga manango ojunampala, mbemele mabannyali jwenio.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu akalemi bala apabammona tu, ngabalengelana, ‘Jonjo nga nnichi. Nyeme tankome ibe ulichi gwakwe ube gwito!’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngabannekela panja ja nng'onda gwa mizabibu nu kunkoma.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngakonya, “Jwajo nkola nng'onda batenda nike akalemi benia?” <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Maika na kakoma bandu benia abapile nng'onda, na kajaika akalemi bange nng'onda gwa mizabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bandu apabajoa genia, ngabalenga, “Ije gakapitilaje!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalolakea ngabakonya, “Majandiko Gachwapi ganga gabi na mana nii?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Libwe elibilikanite akachengi</para>
  <para style="q">ligalambwike kube lyambone kupeta goa.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kila mundu anda agweli panani ja libwe lyenie apakutwekuka ipande, nambu ojulipakung'welela lipa kuntimba.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukonya nhwalo gwa kulepa kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na akakung'i akolongwa ngabamanya kutenda kulandanakia kwenio kwabe kuyenie ngabapala kumpitila, nambu bajogopa bandu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngabapala kingobu echikipaligwa. Ngabahonga bandu bange bikikopekeye kube bambone, ngabatuma bannyonje Yesu kukunkonya ilebe, yenie ibe bampukilange nu kummeka mumakakala ni kinala cha akatawala ba Loma. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bandu bukuingakia benia ngabannenge Yesu, “Aboli, tumanyi kutenda nnenga na kubola ilebe ya kweli, tumanyi kutenda mwenga kupambulaje mundu, mwenga mmola kweli ja ndela ja Nnoongo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mutulengele, anda ipaligwa kulepa kodi ku nkolongwa jwa Loma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya batenda ntega, ngabalengela, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Unayange luela. Bo, kumio na nembo ya beneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Kwa Nngwana jwa Loma,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Mampegange Nkolongwa jwa Loma agabi ga Nngwana jwa Loma, na mampegange Nnoongo agabi ga Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Baotolingeje kunnyonja kwa lilobe lyalyoa papa nnongo ja bandu na yenie ngabatama nuu, bakaomwanga lijango lyakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukonya nhwalo gwa kuyoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Penia Masadukayo abalenga kubije kuyoka. Bange kati jabe ngubunhwikalila Yesu nu kulenga, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Aboli, Musa atulagila nyene, ‘Mundu andawile na kaleka akege gwangabe na mwana nnung'una mundu batole malekwe, kupala bampotole nnung'una gwakwe ingota.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na pakiba na akalongo saba, nkolongwa ngatola munkege mwene ngawe pangabe na mwana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Jwajo nnongomundu jwa pili ngantola nawele jwenio, jwombe uyo ngawe, <verse number="31" style="v"/>na jwa tatu uyo. Ikiba yenie kwa boa saba ngabawe pangabe ningota. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pukujomolela, munkege jola uyo ngawe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bo, lichoba lya kuyoka abawile, munkege jwenio aba jwa beneke? Gambu boa saba bakiba bantoile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bandu ba dunia jenje batenda kutolana nu kutoligwa, <verse number="35" style="v"/>nambu bandu baba Nnoongo abapambwile kuyoka lichoba lya kupela, batolaje wala kutoligwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mababa anda akapakachi bu kumbengu baweje. Ni ingota ya Nnoongo magambu bayokite kuboka kwa abawile. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Na Musa ngachalakicha kube abawile mabayoigwa. Paali pa Majandiko Gachwapi panani ji kindumba chela echikikiba chakajaka mwoto, alenga Angwana anda ‘Nnoongo jwa Ulaimu, Nnoongo jwa Isaka na Nnoongo ja Yakobo.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Jwombe nga Nnoongo jwa ababi bwomi, nambu jwa abawileje, magambu kwakwe boa babi bwomi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Bange akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabalenga, “Aboli, nnyangite tela!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Gambu bajendakije kunkonya yenge ilebe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukonya nhwalo gwa Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Ilengigwabo kutenda Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo nga nchokolo jwa Daudi? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Daudi mwene alenga mukitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Angwana ana Nnoongo ngabalengela Angwana bango,</para>
  <para style="q">Ntame kingonu chango cha kalelo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>mpaka nabeke akangondwa binu kube kitebu cha kubekela makongono ginu.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Anda Daudi ankema jwombe, ‘Angwana,’ lele, iyotobo kube mwana gwakwe?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu baunda bandu nhwalo akaboli ba Malagilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bandu boa apabakiba bakampenekia, Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Mme maha na akaboli ba Malagilo, abapalanga kutyanga ngongo bakwindangite kanju. Kupalamwe kupatigwa abali na bandu kuichima muchoko, kutama paali pa ichima munyumba ja kugongalela na kutola ichima mumipapala, <verse number="47" style="v"/>Baponjanga akanawele nyumba yabe kongo bakakopakea kube bambone kwa magongalelo matandamau. Benia bapakupata hukumu ngolongwa muno!”</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lilumbo lya umama nawele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maluko 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngalola kukuingakia, ngababona matajili apabakiba bakajela malumbo gabe mulichanduku lya Nyumba ja Nnoongo, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ngammona uyo umama jumwe nawele nhwocho akatumbukia mwenio ela ibena njokonjoko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ngalenga, “Nannengelanga kweli, umama nawele jonjo nhwocho ajei munkoba kikolongwa muno kapeta boa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Magambu bandu bina uloi bange boa bapangangite malumbo gabe kuboke mu nyonjakea ja mali yabe, nambu umama nawele jonjo, nambu nhwocho, apangite kila kilebe echapaligwa kujendekea kulama.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alenga kubomoligwa kwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Akinapunji bange bakiba bakalongela nhwalo gwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo, libonekana lina kualala na lina mabwe ga bei ngolongwa, pamwe na malumbo agapangigwe kwa Nnoongo. Yesu ngalenga, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Ganga goa agamagabona, kiika kingobu liigalaje ati libwe limwe panani ja lenge, kila kilebe makibomoligwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga na kupotekigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngabankonya, “Aboli, ilebe yenie ipitila lii? Na kiingi nii echikipakulaya kutenda ilebe yenie ibandaki kupitila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mma maha, makakoloigwaje. Magambu bandu ajingi mabapitila nu kulenga kupete lina lyango, ‘Ne nga Kilisto Nkomboi nambambuligwe na Nnoongo!’ Na ‘Kingobu kiike!’ Nambu makakengamangaje. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pampakujoa nhwalo gwa ngondo na manjega, makajogopaje, magambu mpaka genia gapitile oti, nambu kupela kwa goa tango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ngajendekea kulongela, “Kilambo chimwe kiputana na kilambo chenge, kingwana chimwe kiputana na kingwana chenge. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kupakube malendemelo makolongwa ga lutope kongo na kongo na njala na tauni. Kupakube na ilebe ya kuomongwa na iingi ikolongwa kuboka kumbengu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu tango nu kupitilaje genia goa, bapampukilanga, bapampotekange na kumpelekanga munyumba ya kugongalela na kunnyigililanga mukipungo, bapakupelekwa nnongi ja akangwana na akatawala kwa magambu ga ku amini nenga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kupala unjalakiche kwabe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nnimbange mumyojo jinu, makawachangaje tango na kingobu nhwalo gwa mpakulenga nii, <verse number="15" style="v"/>magambu nenga namwene nampeganga malobe ga mbone, ati akangondwa binu baotolangeje kuimbalila wala kupenga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Achikibelei binu na akanuna binu na akalongo, mabang'aluka mangweto na angweto mabankoma kati jinu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bandu banchimwa mangweto magambu ga liina lyango. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambu, ati lunywili lumwe lwa umutwe jinu luobaje. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kukuimbalila kwinu, mamupokela ukomboi gwinu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alenga kubomoligwa kwa kilambo cha Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maluko 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Pampakulola kilambo cha Yelusalemu kitindiligwe na manjolinjoli, penia mmanyanga kutenda kingobu kiike penia kilambo chenie makibomoligwa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Penia, ababi ku Yudea batililange kuitombi, ababi kunnyini babokange, na ababi kumigonda bakabujaje kunnyini. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwa magambu machoba genia nga machoba ga hukumu, ibe goa agaandikwe galenganile. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bapakulaga akikege bina ndumbo na akinamama ababi ni ilemba eijonga machoba genia! Kwa magambu kupakube na malola makolongwa muno padunia, na kuchimwa kwa Nnoongo kupakaikilila bandu bamba. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bange bakomigwa kwa upanga, bange batoligwa ubanda muilambo yoa, na kilambo cha Yelusalemu makilebatigwa na bandu ba ilambo yenge, mpaka kingobu chabe kulenganila.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuika kwa Mwana jwa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Kupakube na iingi kulichoba na mwei na ndondwa. Ilambo ya padunia ipakube na malola magambu ga mbwele magambu ga luindo lwa mawimbi ga baali. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bandu mabainduka magambu ga mbwele, bakalolela ikobo eipakujipata dunia, magambu ilebe eibi kumbengu, lichoba na mwei na ndondwa ibakutikatika. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Penia, Mwana jwa Mundu akaika mumaunde, juna makakala na kibumo ndu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kingobu ilebe yenie apaipakutumbula kupitila, nnyemange na kujinula mitwe jinu kunani, magambu ukomboi gwinu ubandakile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa nkongo gwa nkoju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabalengela kulandanakia kongo, “Mulolekeyange nkoju na mikongo jenge joa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Apamagabona maamba gatumbu kuipuka, mmanya kutenda mangobu ga mauno gaike. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Uyo, apampa kulola ilebe yenie yakapitila, maumanyanga kube Kingwana cha Nnoongo kibi papipi kuika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nannengelanga kweli, kibelei chenje cha ngoe kipetaje panga kupitila genia goa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mbengu na dunia maipeta, nambu malobe gango gapetaje.</para>
  <para style="s">Mmegange mio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mmegange mio! Mumyojo jinu ikaikaje kulemala na ilebe, nnywagi na kubegelela na itamo yenje. Andaje, lichoba lyale lipakunhwikilila kingobu tu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Magambu inhwikila anda ntambo boa abatamanga padunia poa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mmegange mio, nu kujopa ku Nnoongo mangobu goa ibe nhwotolange kupata makakala ga kupeta chwapi muilebe yenie yoa eipakupitila, nu kujema nnongi ja Mwana jwa Mundu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kingobu cha mui, machoba genia, Yesu akiba akabola bandu ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo, nambu kilo akiba akajenda kukitombi cha Mizeituni nu kutama kwenio. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kindabi ndabi bandu boa bakiba bakajenda ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo kumpenakia jwombe.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gwa kumpuki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpapala gwa mikate janga jeligwa kimela, ogukemigwa Pasaka, ukiba ubandakile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa bapalanga ndela ja kunkoma Yesu, nambu bajogopanga bandu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ajeketela kunng'aluka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lichetani ngilinnyingi Yuda ojwakemigwa Isikalioti, jumwe jwa baba achandundame komi na abena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yuda ngajenda, ngapangana na akakung'i akolongwa na akalenda ba Nyumba ja Nnoongo kube apapa kunng'aluka Yesu kwabe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Angweto ngabaalalila nu kulagana nakwe kunnepa uloi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yuda ngajeketela, ngabe akapala ndela jambone ju kunkamuya kwabe pangamanya bandu ajingi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupanganakia chakulya cha Angwana mpapala gwa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lichoba lya mikate janga jeligwa kimela ngiliika. Lyenie nga lichoba lya mwana limbelele jwa lilumbo lya Pasaka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabakinga Petulo na Yohana, ngabalenge, “Nnyendange makatupanganakie mpapala ili tupate kulye Pasaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Angweto ngabankonya, “Mpala tupangania ko chakulya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ngabalengela, “Mpenikiange! Apampakube makajenda kunnyini, mankongana na munulome ojwapotwi kibega cha mache. Mankengamange mpaka munyumba ejapakujingila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mannengela nkola nyumba, ‘Aboli bankonya, kibikole chumbi echimbakulele mpapala gwa Pasaka pamwe na akinapunji bango?’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Jwombe mannangilage chumbi kikolongwa kugolofa chombe kipanganigwe. Mpangania mwenio.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngabajendanga, ngibikikolanga kila kilebe tela andi Yesu apabalengalinge, ngabapangania mpapala gwa Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Chakulya cha Angwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Akakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kingobu apachalenganila, Yesu ngatama kulye chakulya pamwe na achandundame bakwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngabalengelanga, “Mbaile muno kulye Pasaka jenje pamwe namangweto tango nu kupotekigwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gambu nannengelanga, ndyeje kabele mpaka apipakulenganila Pasaka mu Kingwana cha Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngatola kikombe cha divai, ngannumba Nnoongo, ngalenga, “Mpokelange, mmaganange. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Magambu nannengelanga, nyweje kabele divai ja zabibu mpaka Kingwana cha Nnoongo apikipakuika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kabe ngatola nkate, ngalumba, ngaumetula, ngabapaganga ngalenga, “Gongo nga mmele gwango oguboigwa kamagambu ginu. Ntendange nyenie kukungombokela.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngatenda uyo na kikombe kuboka pukulye, akalenga, “Kikombe chenje nga cha myai jango, ejijitika kwa magambu ginu kupala kulenganakia lilagano liyono. Gongo nga mmele. Ejijitika kwinu, Gange majandiko gakwetije aya jenje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Nambu, nnolange! Jwajo ojwambakung'aluka abi nane upamba pamecha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kweli Mwana jwa Mundu ajenda ukomigwa anda apipangigwe, nambu kulaga kwakwe mundu ojwanng'aluka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Penia ngabatumbu konyana nga meneke kati jito ojwapakamu nhwalo gwenio.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutaukana mene nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ngukupitila kutaukana kati ja akinapunji benia nhwalo gwa mene kati jabe ojwapakube nkolongwa kupeta bange. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Akangwana banga Akayahudi kalongolea bandu babe kwa makakala, na angweto ukemigwa akaganja ba bandu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nambu ikabe yeneje kati jinu, ibe, jwajo ojwabi nkolongwa panakati jinu nga mpaka abe nchokochoko jwa boa, na ojwabi kilongoi mpaka abe anda mmanda. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Gambu mana, nga meneke ojwabi nkolongwa? Jwajo ojwatama pamecha kulye chakulya. Nambu nenga mbile panakati jinu anda mmanda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mangweto makiba nanenga mangobu goa gu kulondoigwa kwango, <verse number="29" style="v"/>na andi Awabango apabangamwiye Kingwana, uyo nanenga nankamuyanga mangweto kingwana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Manniaganga nu kunywe pamecha jango mu Kingwana chango nu kutama muitebu yi kingwana kugahukumula makabi komi na mabena gi kilambo cha Kuisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondola kube Petulo apa kunkana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Simoni, Simoni! Mpenikie! Lichetani lipala lijeketeligwe kuntega mangweto, kuambugana gambone kube mabaja, andi mundu apaeba ngano. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu nenga nannyopile ibe imani jinu jakaobaje. Na mwenga apampakumujila, balimbe mojo akanunabinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Petulo ngannyanga, “Angwana, nenga mbi laachi kujenda pamwe na mwenga kukipungo, na ata kuwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Na nnenge mwe Mapetulo, tango nkokoloko kubekaje leleno mpakungana patatu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kingobu chu kujogoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kubokapenia Yesu ngabakonya akinapunji bakwe, kingobu panankingangita pangapotola uloi na nhuku na ilatu maka pungukigwa na nikilebe chachoa?</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Kileje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Nambu ngoe jwajwoa juna nhuku guloi mpaka apotole, na jwajwoa jwangakola lipanga mpaka auche likoti na aemele lyene. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Magambu nannengelanga Majandiko Gachwapi galenga, ‘Akabekigwa kikuta chimwe na akabaja,’ mpaka galenganile, magambu kila eliandikigwe kunenga nenga liba kweli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabalenga, “Angwana!” Nnole pamba gabi mapanga mabena,</para>
  <para style="p">“Jwombe ngalenga, bai!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agongalela panani pa Kitombi cha Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka pikilambo chenie andi pulukiba lukobo lyakwe ngajenda kukitombi cha Mizeituni, akinapunji bakwe ngabankengama. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Paika kwenio ngabalengela, “Nng'ongalele kupala makalondoigwaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngabaleka ngajenda kutaali pukuoto kuleke mundu liganga, ngakilakatila ngagongalela, <verse number="42" style="v"/>ngalenga “Awawa, andampaile kikombe chenje chukupotekigwa kimbete kutaali na nenga. Andampaile mwenga ngiti pambai neje.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mpakachi kuboka Kumbengu ngampitila kummeka alimbe mojo. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kiti abi ni nu kuechuka muno, ngagongalela ku kwaja liyuke ngilimpita andi matondogolo ga myai ngagatola pae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kuboka pukugongalela ngabajendele akinapunji bakwe ngabakolela bagochile, gambu bakate kuechuka. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ngabalengela, “Mbone nng'ochelanga? Nnyimukange nng'ongalele, kupala makalondoigwaje.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bammeka mumakakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohana 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba tango akalongelaga na nkengeni gwa bandu nguika, akulongalea Yuda, jumwe jwa akinapunji bakwe. Yuda ngajenda kumpata abali Yesu kwa kunkumbatila. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngannenge, “Yuda! Bo, munng'aluka Mwana jwa Mundu kukunkumbatila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe bala apabalola genia ngabalenga, “Angwana, tutumia mapanga gito?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Na jumwe kati ja akinapunji ngamputa upanga mmanda jwa akung'i akolongwa, nganhweketa lichikilo lyakwe lya kalelo. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngalenga, “Nkotoke! Bai.” Ngalikunyula lichikilo lya mundu jwenio, ngalilamia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabalenge akakung'i akolongwa, akananhota ba akalenda ba nyumba ngolongwa ja Nnoongo na akananhota abaikanga kunkamula, “Bo, nhwikangite na mapanga na imbonga kumbukila kube nenga na poki? <verse number="53" style="v"/>Panakiba na mangweto kila lichoba ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo mambukije. Nambu, chenje ngi kingobu chinu ni kinala chulubendu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayo 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maluko 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Penia ngabampukila, ngabantola nu kujenda nakwe ku nyumba ja Nkung'i Nkolongwa. Petulo akiba akakengama unyuma kutaali. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Mwoto bakakungana mu uwa, na Petulo akiba pamwe na abatamangite kujota mwoto gwenio. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kingobu munkege jumwe kati ja akabanda apammona Petulo atamite penia papipi na mwoto, nga nnolokeya kipola nu kulenga, “Mundu ojo uyo akiba pamwe na Yesu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nambu Petulo ngakana, ngalenga, “Mwe! Ne nummanyije.” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Kingobu kachoko, jonge mundu ngammona Petulo, ngalenga, “Mwenga mmi pamwe nabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu Petulo ngajanga, “Mwe, neje!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Kingobu kachoko mundu jonge ngalenga uyo, “Kweli ojo abonekana akiba pamwe nabo, aboka kukilambo cha ku Galilaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Nambu Petulo ngajanga, “Angwana ne mbi kumanyaje channongela!” Na kingobucho, ogwakiba tango akalongela, nkokoloko ngabeka. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Angwana ngabatendebuka ngabannolakeya Petulo na Petulo ngakombakela gaga gabalenga Angwana, “Lele tango nkokoloko nukubekaje mpakungana patatu kutenda ne umanyije.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Penia ngapita panja ngaguta muno.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abekigwa nhwenyo nu kuputigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maluko 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Bandu abanchunga Yesu ngabamputanga nu kummeka nhwenyo. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Angweto ngabamputanga kongo bunhwekele kumio ngabankonya, “Bamputite beneke? Nnondole!” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Na angweto ngabannongela malobe majingi ga kuntukano.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bampeleka nnongi ja Libalacha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>“Pukuchaga, akinanhota na akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabakongana pamwe andi mahakimu, na Yesu ngabanneta nu kummeka nnongi ja Libalacha lyenie.” <verse number="67" style="v"/>Ngabalenga, “Mutulengele mwe Kilisto ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajanga, “Anda nannengile unhwaminije, <verse number="68" style="v"/>na anda nankonyite lichwali, nnyangangaje. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Nambu kuboka ngoe Mwana jwa Mundu abakutama kingonu cha kalelo ja Nnoongo juna Makakala.” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Angweto boa ngabalenga, “Ikonda mwe ma Mwana ba Nnoongo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Jwombe ngajanga, “Mangweto nnengite, nenga nga jwenio.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Angweto ngabalenga, “Bo tupala uchaili gonge? Tubene tujoine palenga!”</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bampeleka kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Penia nkengeni gwoa ngujema, ngugumpeleka Yesu ku Pilato, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ngabatumbula kuntakiana bakalenga, “Tankolela mundu jonjo akaaoya bandu bito, bakanakia bandu kulepa kodi kwa Nkolongwa jwa Loma nu kukikema eti jwombe nga Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pilato ngankonya Yesu, “Mwe nga Mangwana ba Akayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajanga, “Mwe nnengite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilato ngabalengela akakung'i akolongwa nankengeni gwa bandu, “Mbi kulibonaje lilemwa kwa mundu jonjo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngabajendekea kulenga, “Babola bandu boa ba ku Yudea babe na kijonga. Atumbula ku Galilaya na ngoe abi pamba.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bampeleka kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pilato apajoa genia, ngakonya, “Bo, mundu jonjo jwa ku Galilaya?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apamanya kube Yesu abi pae ji kinala cha Helode, ngampeleka kwa Helode, ojwakiba Kuyelusalemu kingobu chenie. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Helode ngaala mwojo muno apammona Yesu, magambu ngajoa minhalo jakwe. Ahyobalela ammone Yesu akatenda ikobo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Penia Helode ngankonya Yesu machwali ndu, nambu Yesu ajangiteje lilobe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabapitila nnongi na ngabantakiana Yesu ngumbi ndu ngolongolo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Helode pamwe na manjolinjoli gakwe, ngagankoya oni Yesu nu kuntendela nhwenyo, kuboka penia ngabankwindiya ngobo ja kingwana, ngabammuyanga kwa Pilato. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Helode na Pilato, pukutumbula bakibanga na bulwa, nambu kuboka lichoba lyenie ngababe maganja.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahukumigwa kuwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilato ngakema ngongano ja akakung'i akolongwa na akiilongoi ba bandu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>na ngabalengela, “Mannetangite mundu jonjo kwango malenga akiba akaoyanga bandu. Ngoe mpenakiange! Kuboka pa kuingakia kilebe chenie nnongi jinu, nammwenije na lilemwa wala limwe nhwalo gwa ngumbi yinu kwakwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu ne tuje, ati Helode alibwenije lilemwa lyalyoa magambu ammujikie kwango. Kweli kibije kilebe chachoa echakamwile mundu jonjo cha kupaligwa kuwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuyenie, amulicha aputigwe iboko, kuboka penia nannekekea.” Majandiko gange gakwetije aya ja <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kila lichoba lya Mpapala gwa Pasaka, Pilato akiba nu lukobo lwa kunnyogolela mpungwa jumwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambu boa ngabachobela pamwe, “Akomigwe! Mannekeke Balaba kwito!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Balaba akiba ajigiligwe mukipungo magambu gu kujambukia kijonga kunnyini uyo pamwe nu ukoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pilato ngapala kunnekekea Yesu, penia ngalongela nabo kabele. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngabachobela, “Mammambe munchalaba! Mammambe munchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilato ngabalengela mala ja patatu, “Atei ubaja gani? Ne mbi kulibonaje lilemwa elyapaligwa komigwa! Namputa iboko nu kunnekekea.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngabayangala kuchobela kanonoya, kube Yesu kupala abambigwe munchalaba, pukujomolela Pilato ngabajeketela. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pilato gatenda agabapalanga gakamuligwe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pilato ngannekeke mundu ojwabampala, ojwakajigiligwa mukipungo gambu gwa kijonga na ukomi, ngankamuya Yesu kwabe bantendelange andi pabapalanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atenda kubambigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Manjolinjoli apabampeleka Yesu, undela apabakiba bakajabula, ngabakongana na mundu jumwe ojwakemigwa Simoni jwa Kulene, ojwakiba akabokela kunng'onda. Ngabampukila, ngabantweka nchalaba aupotole, kunyuma ja Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nkenga nkolongwa gwa bandu ngugunkengama, kati jabe bakiba akikege abakiba bakakokaleka na kung'utila. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu ngabagalambukila nu kulenga, “Makina mama ba Kuyelusalemu! Makang'utije nenga, nambu nng'uta kwa magambu ginu na magambu ga ingota yinu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Magambu machoba gatenda kuika penia bandu mabalenga, ‘Mbaya jabe akege bangabe na mwana na bangajonga ingota!’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie, bandu nga apabapakuilengela itombi, ‘Mutuponelange!’ Ni itombi ichokoichoko, ‘Tuekelelange!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gambu, anda bandu batenda yene kwa nkongo mmehe, ipakubebo kwa nkongo nnyomo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bakibanga bandu akabena uyo, akabaja, bakomigwe pamwe na Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Apabaikanga paali apakemigwe, “Kitongo cha Mutwe,” ngabammamba Yesu penia, pamwe na akabaja abena bala, jumwe kingonu chakwe cha kalelo na jumwe kangeja. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Awawa malekekeyange malemwa gabe magambu bamanyije echibakamula.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngababagana ngobo yakwe kwa kuoma kiumbuumbu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bandu bakiba penia bakalolela kingobu akiilongoi ba Akayahudi apabantendela nhwenyo, “Akombwile bange, ngoe akikombole mwene, anda jwombe nga Kilisto Nkomboi, ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Manjolinjoli ngabantende nhwenyo uyo, ngabannyendela ngabampe siki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>bakalenga, “Anda kweli mwe Mangwana ba Akayahudi, mikikombole mmene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Panani ja nchalaba ngababeka kibao echibaandike yene, “Jonjo nga Nngwana jwa Akayahudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Jumwe kati ja akabaja abakiba babambigwe panchalaba, ngantukana akalenga, “Bo, mweje nga Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo? Mikikombole mmene na twe uyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nambu mmaja jonge jola ngankalapila nnyakwe akalenga, “Mwe kunnyogopaje Nnoongo? Mwe mpatite hukumu andi ujaje. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwe na nenga tupaligwa kupata hukumu jenje, magambu ganga nga malepo ga agatukamwile, nambu mundu ojo akamwije kilebe kibaja.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Penia ngannengela Yesu, “Yesu ungombakele ne kingobu apampakujingi mu Kingwana chinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Nannenge kweli, lele mma pamwe na nenga kupepo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kiu cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ikiba anda saa sita ja mui, lichoba ngilileka kujaka na lubendu nguluekelela dunia joa mpaka saa tisa, <verse number="45" style="v"/>panjia ejikiba jibekigwe panakati ja Nyumba ja Nnoongo ngijipachuka ipande ibena kuboka kunani mpaka pae. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu ngaguta kanonoya, “Awawa, mukuboko jinu nubeka mwojo gwango.” Apajomola kulenga genia ngajomoka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Penia kilongoi jwa akalenda ba Loma apalola agapitile, ngannumba Nnoongo akalenga, “Kweli ojo akiba mundu jwa mbone jwa Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Bandu boa abakiba bakonganinge penia kulola kilebe chenie, apabalola genia agapitile, ngababuja kachabe bikikiputa itibi yabe kukuechuka. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Akaganja mundu boa pamwe na akikege bala abankengima kuboka ku Galilaya, ngabajema kutaali bakalolela kilebe chenie.</para>
  <para style="s">Machiko ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:56-61">Matayo 27:56-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42">Maluko 15:42</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kukiba na mundu ojwakemigwa Yusufu, akiba mundu jwa mwojo gwa mbone akatenda agunhwalali Nnoongo na akiba jumwe kati ja bandu bilibalacha likolongwa li Kiyahudi, <verse number="51" style="v"/>jwenio ngakana kujeketela chabaamua akilongoi ajabe. Yusufu akiba aboka kukijiji chimwe cha Akayahudi echikikemigwa Alimatayo. Akiba akalendela kuika kwa Kingwana cha Nnoongo. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ngajenda kwa Pilato, ngajopa bampe mmele gwa Yesu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Penia ngauluya mmele gwa Yesu kuboka munchalaba, ngaubiligila chanda cha kitani, ngaubeka mulikabuli elikiba baembite piliganga, elikiba tango lyanatumikaje. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lichoba lyenie likiba ijumaa, nu kupanganikia kwa Lichoba lya Kupomalela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Akikege abankengema Yesu kuboke ku Galilaya ngabankengama Yusufu na ngibilibona likabuli na mmele gwa Yesu pubekigwe. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kuboka penia, ngababuja ukaja, ngabapanganila mauta ginakunungila nu kuupakaya mmele gwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Lichoba lya Kupomalela ngabapomolela andi apiamuligwe na Malagilo.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jumapili kindabindabi muno, akikege bala ngabajenda kulikabuli bapotwi mauta ginakunungila agapanganile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngibilikolela libwe lela lipilimbiigwe libi pambwega ja nniango gwa likabuli.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="24:2">Libwe lipilimbiigwe libi pambwega ja nniango gu likabuli</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apabajingila nkati, bubwenije mmele gwa Nngwana Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apabakibanga tango bakaomwanga ku nhwalo gwenio, kingobutu akinalome abena abakwindite ngobo ina kung'ala muno, bajemite papipi nabo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Akikege benia ngababeganga na mbwele, ngabalitanga. Penia bandu bala ngabakonya, “Mboni mampalanga ojwabi mmomi kati ja abawile? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Abije pamba, ayokite. Nkombokelange agannengelanga apakiba kwako ku Galilaya, <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Mwana jwa Mundu mpaka abekigwe kwa bandu akabaja, angweto mabammamba munchalaba na lichoba lya tatu mayoka.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Penia akinamama benia ngabagakombokela malobe gakwe, <verse number="9" style="v"/>ngababujanga kuboka pilikabuli, ngabapeganga achandundame bala komi na bamwe na akinapunji bange nhwalo gwa ilebe yenie yoa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Benia abalenga nhwalo gwenio kwa achandundame nga, Maliamu Magidalena, Yoana na Maliamu amamundu Yakobo, pamwe na akanamama bange ababakalongwana nabo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Achandundame ngabagatolanga malobe genia anda gambonije, nyenie baaminingije. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu Petulo ngaboka, ngajabu lubelo mpaka kumambi. Apalita kulinga nkati, ngajibona chanda jika tu. Ngabuja ukaja kongo akaomwanga ku genia agapitile.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja kujenda ku Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maluko 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lichoba ulyo, abele kati ja akinapunji bakwe Yesu ngababe bakajenda ku kijiji chimwe echikikemigwa Emau, kulipa kwakwe maili saba kuboka Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bakibanga bakalongelanga genia goa agapitile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apabakibanga bakalongelanga na kugawachila, Yesu mwene ngapitila, ngatyanga pamwe nabo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>ngabammona kwa mio, nambu bummanyije.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonyanga, “Nnongelangani kongo makajendanga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Angweto ngabajemanga nu, kumio kwabe bakiba baechwike. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Jumwe ojwakemigwa Keleopa, ngannyanga, “Bo, mwe nga mageni jika jinu Kuyelusalemu mangamanya agapitile kwenio machoba gano?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Benia ngabajanga, “Nhwalo nike?” Angweto ngabannyanga,</para>
  <para style="p">“Nhwalo ogugumpatite Yesu jwa Nazaleti,” ngabannyanga. “Mundu jonjo akiba nnondoli jwa Nnoongo juna uwecho gwa ukamula na kubola nnongi ja Nnoongo na nnongi ja bandu boa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Akakung'i na akiilongoi bito ngabampiya aukumigwe kuwe, ngabammamba munchalaba. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na ngutuhyobalela kutenda jwenio mabakombola bandu ba Kuisilaeli! Genia goa, tangu gapitile lele lichoba lya tatu kuboka pa kutendigwa genia. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bange akikege ba kachito butujitwie mwojo. Bajeilinge kulikabuli kindabi, <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu bubwenije mmele gwakwe. Ngababujanga ngabalenga angweto bapiti mpakachi kuboka kumbengu jwabalengi kube abi mmomi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bandu bito bange ngabajabu kuingikia nhwalo gwenio gubalengite akikege, nambu benia bamwenije.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngabalengela benia, “Mbone mmi makajinga yene, na myojo jinu kujundupa ku amini ilebe yoa ibalenga akalondoli ba Nnoongo! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Apaligweje Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo kupotekigwa, na yene ajingile mukibumo chakwe?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na Yesu ngabalandulila angweto Majandiko goa agannenga mwene, kutumbu kitabu cha Musa na majandiko goa ga akalondoli Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Angweto pabakibandakila kijiji chibikijendelelaga, Yesu ngajiga anda apa kukipeta kujendekea na mwanja, <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nambu benia ngaba nnyopa kulenga, “Ntame upambano natwenga lichoba litipike na lubakube lubendu.” Yenie ngajenda kupomolela na benia. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ngatama pae kulye nabenia, ngatola nkate, ngannumba Nnoongo ngaumetula ngabapeganga. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kingobu tu mio gabe ngagaotola kummona Yesu, nambu jwombe ngaoba paali penia. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ngabalengelana bene kwa bene, “Bo myojo jito jijakiteje nkati jito kingobu apatulandulila Majandiko kundela kola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Benia ngabajimukanga kingobucho ngababuja kukilambo cha Kuyelusalemu, kwenio ngabakolela achandundame komi na jumwe bakonganinge pamwe na bange. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Na ngabalenga, “Angwana bayokite kweli, ampiti Simoni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bandu benia ngabalandulila agapitile kundela, na apabammanya Nngwana apakiba akametula nkate.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapiti akinapunji bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Itendwa 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kingobu benia akabena pabalandulila genia, Yesu mwene ngajema panakati jabe nu kulenga, “Tengela jibe kwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Angweto ngabajituka nu kube na mbwele, bakita bilibweni lihoka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nambu jwombe ngalenga, “Mbone nhwechukanga? Mbone mmi na mbwele mumyojo jinu? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nnole maboko gango na makongono gango mammanya kube nga nnenga. Umbapayange mmone, magambu lihoka likwetije mmele na iyupa andi pummonanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ngalenga genia nakalayanga benia maboko na makongono gakwe. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pabakibanga tango bangaamini magambu ga laa jabe, na kongo bakaomwangwa, jwombe ngabakonya, “Nkweti kilebe chachoa chu kulye?” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Benia ngabampe kipande cha chamaki ju kuteleka, <verse number="43" style="v"/>ngatola ngalye boa ngabammona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Penia ngabalengela, “Chenje nga chinannengelanga tango panakiba pamwe namangweto, kila kilebe echikiandikigwe nhwalo gwango nenga, mu Malagilo ga Musa na kitabu cha akalondoli, na Zabuli kilenganile lele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Penia ngabawekula mawacho gabe ibe bagamanye Majandiko Gachwapi. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ngabalengela, “Nga apiandikwe, kube Kilisto Nkomboi mabambigwa na lichoba lya tatu mayoka kuboka kwa abawile, <verse number="47" style="v"/>na ku liina lyakwe nhwalo gwa kulapa mabaja na kulekekigwa malemwa mpaka oti utangachigwe mwilambo yoa, kutumbu Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mangweto nga makachaili bu nhwalo gongo. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ne namwene manunnetela jwajo Awawa ojubalagila. Nambu munnendanga ukongo kunnyini mpaka pampakupoke makakala agaboka kunani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atoligwa kujenda kumbengu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maluko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Itendwa 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Penia ngabalongolea panja ja nnyini mpaka ku Betania, ngatondobea maboko gakwe kunani, ngabalumika. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Apakiba akalumika, ngabalekanga, ngatoligwa kumbengu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Angweto ngabanng'ongalela, penia ngababujanga Kuyelusalemu babi na laa ngolongwa, <verse number="53" style="v"/>mangobu goa ngabatamanga kuibanja ya Nyumba ja Nnoongo bakannumba Nnoongo.</para>
</usx>
